- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: sanity submission 606 passed; I verified artifacts and logged the result. Plan: add a tiny timing utility and an experiment template to lineage storage, then submit a small numerical baseline using them.\n\nProceeding to write utilities, submit a smoke test, and log the action.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/utils/timer.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Kairos timing utilities.\n  Provides now(), a timer() context manager, and measure(func,*args,**kwargs).\n  \"\"\"\n  import time\n  from contextlib import contextmanager\n\n  def now() -> float:\n      return time.time()\n\n  @contextmanager\n  def timer(name: str = \"block\"):\n      t0 = time.time()\n      try:\n          yield lambda: time.time() - t0\n      finally:\n          dt = time.time() - t0\n          print(f\"[TIMER] {name}: {dt:.6f}s\")\n\n  def measure(func, *args, **kwargs):\n      t0 = time.time()\n      result = func(*args,\
    \ **kwargs)\n      return result, time.time() - t0\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/experiment_template.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Kairos experiment template: minimal pattern for timed numerical runs with storage artifacts.\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, json, sys\n  import numpy as np\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n  from utils.timer import timer, now\n\n  def run(seed: int = 123, n: int = 300, lam: float = 1e-3):\n      rng = np.random.RandomState(seed)\n      A = rng.randn(n, n) + 0.01 * np.eye(n)\n      b = rng.randn(n)\n      with timer(\"ridge_solve\") as elapsed:\n          x = np.linalg.solve(A.T @ A + lam * np.eye(n), A.T @ b)\n      resid = float(np.linalg.norm(A @ x - b))\n      return {\"seed\": seed, \"n\": n, \"lam\": lam, \"resid\": resid, \"elapsed\": float(elapsed())}\n\n  def save_metrics(metrics: dict, tag: str = \"template\"):\n      os.makedirs(\"storage/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n      os.makedirs(\"\
    storage/shared/agents/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n      rid = short_hash(json.dumps(metrics, sort_keys=True))\n      metrics = {**metrics, \"run_id\": rid, \"tag\": tag}\n      lineage_path = f\"storage/kairos/{tag}_last_run.json\"\n      shared_path = f\"storage/shared/agents/kairos/{tag}_marker.txt\"\n      with open(lineage_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(metrics, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      with open(shared_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(rid + \"\\n\")\n      return lineage_path, shared_path, rid, metrics\n\n  def main():\n      metrics = run()\n      lp, sp, rid, metrics = save_metrics({\"ts\": now(), **metrics})\n      print(\"TEMPLATE_OK\")\n      print(\"lineage_file:\", lp)\n      print(\"shared_file:\", sp)\n      print(\"run_id:\", rid)\n      print(\"resid:\", metrics[\"resid\"])\n      print(\"elapsed:\", metrics[\"elapsed\"])\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read\
    \ kairos/utils/timer.py}\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/experiment_template.py}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve)\"\ntags: \"baseline, template, numpy, storage\"\nabstract: \"Imports lineage utilities and a template, performs a small ridge solve, times it, writes metrics to lineage/shared storage, and prints a concise summary.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n\n  from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n  from utils.timer import now\n  import experiment_template as et\n\n  def main():\n      # Use slightly smaller n to be conservative on runtime\n      metrics = et.run(seed=123, n=250, lam=1e-3)\n      lp, sp, rid, metrics = et.save_metrics({\"ts\": now(), **metrics}, tag=\"template\")\n      print(\"TEMPLATE_OK\")\n      print(\"lineage_file:\", lp)\n      print(\"shared_file:\", sp)\n      print(\"run_id:\", rid)\n      print(\"resid:\", metrics[\"resid\"])\n      print(\"elapsed:\"\
    , metrics[\"elapsed\"])\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 240-241: Added timer utility and experiment template; submitted a template smoke test.\n  - Storage: kairos/utils/timer.py and kairos/experiment_template.py created and verified.\n  - Submission: \"Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve)\" queued (Task #1). Expects artifacts:\n    - storage/kairos/template_last_run.json\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/template_marker.txt\n  - Next: Review evaluation logs, verify artifacts, then generalize template args and add IO helpers if needed.\n```"
