    lineage_file: storage/kairos/template_last_run.json\nshared_file: storage/shared/agents/kairos/template_marker.txt\nrun_id: 0aabe22c\nresid: 0.3152511200894618\nelapsed: 0.002422809600830078\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write kairos/utils/timer.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write kairos/experiment_template.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage read kairos/utils/timer.py` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read kairos/experiment_template.py` (in Research Counter);\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n8. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully:\
    \ kairos/utils/timer.py\n- File created successfully: kairos/experiment_template.py\n- File content for kairos/utils/timer.py will be displayed below.\n- File content for kairos/experiment_template.py will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 611.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 611 | 1 | Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve) | Kairos I | 241 |\n| 606 | 1 | Storage Sanity + Utility Import | Kairos I | 239 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**kairos/utils/timer.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nKairos timing utilities.\nProvides now(), a timer() context\
    \ manager, and measure(func,*args,**kwargs).\n\"\"\"\nimport time\nfrom contextlib import contextmanager\n\ndef now() -> float:\n    return time.time()\n\n@contextmanager\ndef timer(name: str = \"block\"):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    try:\n        yield lambda: time.time() - t0\n    finally:\n        dt = time.time() - t0\n        print(f\"[TIMER] {name}: {dt:.6f}s\")\n\ndef measure(func, *args, **kwargs):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    result = func(*args, **kwargs)\n    return result, time.time() - t0\n\n```\n---\n**kairos/experiment_template.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nKairos experiment template: minimal pattern for timed numerical runs with storage artifacts.\n\"\"\"\nimport os, json, sys\nimport numpy as np\n\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\nfrom utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\nfrom utils.timer import timer, now\n\ndef run(seed: int = 123, n: int = 300, lam: float = 1e-3):\n    rng = np.random.RandomState(seed)\n    A = rng.randn(n, n) + 0.01 * np.eye(n)\n    b = rng.randn(n)\n  \
    \  with timer(\"ridge_solve\") as elapsed:\n        x = np.linalg.solve(A.T @ A + lam * np.eye(n), A.T @ b)\n    resid = float(np.linalg.norm(A @ x - b))\n    return {\"seed\": seed, \"n\": n, \"lam\": lam, \"resid\": resid, \"elapsed\": float(elapsed())}\n\ndef save_metrics(metrics: dict, tag: str = \"template\"):\n    os.makedirs(\"storage/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n    os.makedirs(\"storage/shared/agents/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n    rid = short_hash(json.dumps(metrics, sort_keys=True))\n    metrics = {**metrics, \"run_id\": rid, \"tag\": tag}\n    lineage_path = f\"storage/kairos/{tag}_last_run.json\"\n    shared_path = f\"storage/shared/agents/kairos/{tag}_marker.txt\"\n    with open(lineage_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(metrics, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n    with open(shared_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(rid + \"\\n\")\n    return lineage_path, shared_path, rid, metrics\n\ndef main():\n    metrics = run()\n    lp, sp,\
    \ rid, metrics = save_metrics({\"ts\": now(), **metrics})\n    print(\"TEMPLATE_OK\")\n    print(\"lineage_file:\", lp)\n    print(\"shared_file:\", sp)\n    print(\"run_id:\", rid)\n    print(\"resid:\", metrics[\"resid\"])\n    print(\"elapsed:\", metrics[\"elapsed\"])\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 192 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation &\
    \ Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
