parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Evaluation 611 ran successfully (ridge solve template), producing lineage/shared artifacts. Plan: verify artifacts explicitly, add I/O utilities to lineage storage, and log results.\n\nProceeding to verify, extend utils, and update the changelog.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage list kairos}\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/template_last_run.json}\n\n/execute_action{storage list shared/agents/kairos}\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/agents/kairos/template_marker.txt}\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/utils/io.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Kairos I/O utilities for JSON and text files.\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, json\n\n  __all__ = [\"ensure_parent_dir\", \"write_json\", \"read_json\", \"write_text\", \"read_text\"]\n\n  def ensure_parent_dir(path: str) -> str:\n      d = os.path.dirname(path)\n      if d:\n          os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n      return path\n\n  def write_json(path:\
    \ str, obj) -> str:\n      ensure_parent_dir(path)\n      with open(path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(obj, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      return path\n\n  def read_json(path: str, default=None):\n      try:\n          with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n              return json.load(f)\n      except FileNotFoundError:\n          return default\n\n  def write_text(path: str, text: str) -> str:\n      ensure_parent_dir(path)\n      with open(path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(text)\n      return path\n\n  def read_text(path: str, default=None):\n      try:\n          with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n              return f.read()\n      except FileNotFoundError:\n          return default\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/utils/io.py}\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 241-242: Template evaluation verified and utilities extended.\n\
    \  - Eval 611 (\"Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve)\"): SUCCESS.\n    - Output: TEMPLATE_OK; timer printed for ridge_solve.\n    - Metrics: resid ≈ 0.3152511, elapsed ≈ 0.0024228s, run_id = 0aabe22c.\n  - Artifacts (verified):\n    - Lineage: storage/kairos/template_last_run.json (contains run_id, resid, elapsed, seed, n, lam, ts).\n    - Shared: storage/shared/agents/kairos/template_marker.txt (run_id marker).\n  - Utilities:\n    - Added utils/timer.py and experiment_template.py (prior).\n    - Added utils/io.py (JSON/text helpers with ensure_parent_dir).\n  - Next:\n    1) Generalize experiment_template with CLI args (seeds, n, lam) and multi-run aggregation.\n    2) Add simple metrics aggregator submission and log comparative results.\n    3) Keep artifacts small and namespaced.\n```"
