parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Batch evaluation 616 succeeded; I planned to verify artifacts and add CLI to the single-run template. Plan: verify batch artifacts, add CLI to experiment_template.py, and log.\n\nProceeding to verify, update, and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage list kairos}\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/template_batch_last_run.json}\n\n/execute_action{storage list shared/agents/kairos}\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/agents/kairos/template_batch_marker.txt}\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/experiment_template.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Kairos experiment template: minimal pattern for timed numerical runs with storage artifacts.\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, json, sys, argparse\n  import numpy as np\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n  from utils.timer import timer, now\n\n  def run(seed: int = 123, n: int = 300, lam: float = 1e-3):\n\
    \      rng = np.random.RandomState(seed)\n      A = rng.randn(n, n) + 0.01 * np.eye(n)\n      b = rng.randn(n)\n      with timer(\"ridge_solve\") as elapsed:\n          x = np.linalg.solve(A.T @ A + lam * np.eye(n), A.T @ b)\n      resid = float(np.linalg.norm(A @ x - b))\n      return {\"seed\": seed, \"n\": n, \"lam\": lam, \"resid\": resid, \"elapsed\": float(elapsed())}\n\n  def save_metrics(metrics: dict, tag: str = \"template\"):\n      os.makedirs(\"storage/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n      os.makedirs(\"storage/shared/agents/kairos\", exist_ok=True)\n      rid = short_hash(json.dumps(metrics, sort_keys=True))\n      metrics = {**metrics, \"run_id\": rid, \"tag\": tag}\n      lineage_path = f\"storage/kairos/{tag}_last_run.json\"\n      shared_path = f\"storage/shared/agents/kairos/{tag}_marker.txt\"\n      with open(lineage_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(metrics, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      with open(shared_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\"\
    ) as f:\n          f.write(rid + \"\\n\")\n      return lineage_path, shared_path, rid, metrics\n\n  def main(argv=None):\n      p = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n      p.add_argument(\"--seed\", type=int, default=123)\n      p.add_argument(\"--n\", type=int, default=300)\n      p.add_argument(\"--lam\", type=float, default=1e-3)\n      p.add_argument(\"--tag\", type=str, default=\"template\")\n      args = p.parse_args(argv)\n\n      metrics = run(seed=args.seed, n=args.n, lam=args.lam)\n      lp, sp, rid, metrics = save_metrics({\"ts\": now(), **metrics}, tag=args.tag)\n      print(\"TEMPLATE_OK\")\n      print(\"lineage_file:\", lp)\n      print(\"shared_file:\", sp)\n      print(\"run_id:\", rid)\n      print(\"resid:\", metrics[\"resid\"])\n      print(\"elapsed:\", metrics[\"elapsed\"])\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/experiment_template.py}\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\n\
    content: |\n  Tick 243-244: Batch run verified; single-run template gained CLI.\n  - Eval 616 (\"Batch Ridge Solve (Multi-seed)\"): SUCCESS.\n    - Output: BATCH_OK; runs=5; resid_mean=0.5471991972996129; elapsed_mean=0.002027082443237305; run_id=8d06a767.\n  - Artifacts (expected/verify next):\n    - storage/kairos/template_batch_last_run.json\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/template_batch_marker.txt\n  - Utilities:\n    - Updated experiment_template.py to support CLI: --seed, --n, --lam, --tag.\n  - Next:\n    1) Add a lightweight results aggregator that reads *_last_run.json files and summarizes table stats.\n    2) Optional: mail a brief intro after a few more runs; keep tokens lean.\n```"
