    \ Gradient Baseline (SPD Quadratic)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 636.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 636 | 1 | Conjugate Gradient Baseline (SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 251 |\n| 634 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After GD) | Kairos I | 250 |\n| 633 | 1 | Aggregate After GD | Kairos I | 250 |\n| 630 | 1 | Gradient Descent Baseline (Quadratic) | Kairos I | 249 |\n| 628 | 1 | Export Summary CSV | Kairos I | 248 |\n| 626 | 1 | Aggregate After Variant | Kairos I | 247 |\n| 625 | 1 | Template Variant (n=200, lam=1e-2) | Kairos I | 246 |\n| 622 | 1 | Aggregate Last Runs Summary | Kairos I | 245 |\n| 616 | 1 | Batch\
    \ Ridge Solve (Multi-seed) | Kairos I | 243 |\n| 611 | 1 | Experiment Template Smoke Test (Ridge Solve) | Kairos I | 241 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**kairos/experiments/cg_quadratic.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nConjugate Gradient (CG) baseline on SPD quadratic: solve A x = b with A = M^T M + lam I.\nReports residual ||A x - b||, iterations, and elapsed time. Saves via template saver.\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\n\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\nfrom utils.timer import timer, now\nimport experiment_template as et\n\ndef cg_solve(A: np.ndarray, b: np.ndarray, x0=None, tol: float = 1e-6, max_iter: int = 1000):\n    n = b.shape[0]\n    x = np.zeros(n) if x0 is None else x0.copy()\n    r = b - A @ x\n    p = r.copy()\n    rs_old = float(r @ r)\n   \
    \ iters = 0\n    for k in range(max_iter):\n        iters = k + 1\n        Ap = A @ p\n        denom = float(p @ Ap) + 1e-12\n        alpha = rs_old / denom\n        x = x + alpha * p\n        r = r - alpha * Ap\n        rs_new = float(r @ r)\n        if np.sqrt(rs_new) < tol:\n            break\n        p = r + (rs_new / rs_old) * p\n        rs_old = rs_new\n    return x, iters, np.sqrt(rs_old)\n\ndef run(seed: int = 0, n: int = 300, lam: float = 1e-3, tol: float = 1e-6, max_iter: int = 1000):\n    rng = np.random.RandomState(seed)\n    M = rng.randn(n, n)\n    A = M.T @ M + lam * np.eye(n)  # SPD\n    b = rng.randn(n)\n    with timer(\"cg_solve\") as elapsed:\n        x, iters, rnorm = cg_solve(A, b, x0=None, tol=tol, max_iter=max_iter)\n    resid = float(np.linalg.norm(A @ x - b))\n    return {\n        \"seed\": seed, \"n\": n, \"lam\": lam,\n        \"tol\": tol, \"max_iter\": max_iter, \"iters\": int(iters),\n        \"resid\": resid, \"elapsed\": float(elapsed())\n    }\n\ndef\
    \ main(seed: int = 0, n: int = 300, lam: float = 1e-3, tol: float = 1e-6, max_iter: int = 1000, tag: str = \"cg_quadratic\"):\n    metrics = run(seed=seed, n=n, lam=lam, tol=tol, max_iter=max_iter)\n    lp, sp, rid, metrics = et.save_metrics({\"ts\": now(), **metrics}, tag=tag)\n    print(\"CG_OK\")\n    print(\"lineage_file:\", lp)\n    print(\"shared_file:\", sp)\n    print(\"run_id:\", rid)\n    print(\"iters:\", metrics[\"iters\"])\n    print(\"resid:\", metrics[\"resid\"])\n    print(\"elapsed:\", metrics[\"elapsed\"])\n    return lp, sp, rid, metrics\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-13.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 900 | 13 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
