    \ EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCSV_OK\ncsv_file: storage/kairos/summary_last.csv\nmarker_file: storage/shared/agents/kairos/summary_csv_marker.txt\nrows: 6\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Aggregate After Scaled-CG (refresh)' (ID: 652) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nAGG_OK\nsummary_file: storage/kairos/summary_last.json\nmarker: 0e62188a\ntotal_entries: 7\nTABLE: tag | run_id | resid | elapsed | runs\ncg_quadratic | cadd018e | 7.983241867626301e-07 | 0.011696577072143555 | 1\npcg_quadratic | 7f2d14a5 | 2.2641854337074727e-06 | 0.0270535945892334 | 1\nscaled_cg_quadratic | 0c5dd45e | 1.6400825623770613e-05 | 0.01300954818725586 | 1\ntemplate | 0aabe22c | 0.3152511200894618 | 0.002422809600830078\
    \ | 1\ntemplate_batch | 8d06a767 | 0.5471991972996129 | 0.002027082443237305 | 5\ntemplate_n200 | b0ca8e2f | 0.7318398097628631 | 0.0015025138854980469 | 1\ngd_quadratic | c76264ff | 3.6297518842596443 | 0.0023055076599121094 | 1\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_last_run.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage list shared/agents/kairos` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_marker.txt` (in Research Counter);\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n8. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research\
    \ Counter.\n- File content for kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_last_run.json will be displayed below.\n- File list for shared/agents/kairos will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_marker.txt will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Aggregate After Scaled-CG (refresh)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 652.\n- Evaluation 'Export Summary CSV (After Scaled-CG, refresh)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 653.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 653 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Scaled-CG, refresh) | Kairos I | 258 |\n| 652 | 1 |\
    \ Aggregate After Scaled-CG (refresh) | Kairos I | 258 |\n| 651 | 1 | Aggregate After Scaled-CG | Kairos I | 257 |\n| 650 | 1 | Scaled Conjugate Gradient (Diagonal Scaling, SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 257 |\n| 649 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (Refresh after PCG, v2) | Kairos I | 256 |\n| 648 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After PCG) | Kairos I | 255 |\n| 647 | 1 | Aggregate After PCG | Kairos I | 255 |\n| 645 | 1 | Preconditioned CG Baseline (Jacobi, SPD Quadratic) | Kairos I | 254 |\n| 642 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (Refresh after CG) | Kairos I | 253 |\n| 640 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After CG) | Kairos I | 252 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/agents/kairos:**\n- cg_quadratic_marker.txt\n- gd_quadratic_marker.txt\n- pcg_quadratic_marker.txt\n- sanity.txt\n\
    - scaled_cg_quadratic_marker.txt\n- summary_csv_marker.txt\n- summary_marker.txt\n- template_batch_marker.txt\n- template_marker.txt\n- template_n200_marker.txt\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_last_run.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"ts\": 1761198128.6113458,\n  \"seed\": 0,\n  \"n\": 300,\n  \"lam\": 0.001,\n  \"tol\": 1e-06,\n  \"max_iter\": 1000,\n  \"iters\": 555,\n  \"resid\": 1.6400825623770613e-05,\n  \"elapsed\": 0.01300954818725586,\n  \"run_id\": \"0c5dd45e\",\n  \"tag\": \"scaled_cg_quadratic\"\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/agents/kairos/scaled_cg_quadratic_marker.txt:**\n```\n0c5dd45e\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-20.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 1442 | 20 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
