- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Bench run 661 completed; it produced bench_compare_last_run.json with best residual from PCG and fastest from GD. Plan: verify artifacts, aggregate to include the bench entry, export CSV, then log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/bench_compare_last_run.json}\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/agents/kairos/bench_compare_marker.txt}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Aggregate After Bench\"\ntags: \"analysis, aggregation, storage\"\nabstract: \"Re-runs aggregator to include bench_compare_last_run.json and update summary + marker.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  import tools.aggregate as agg\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      agg.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export Summary CSV (After Bench)\"\ntags: \"analysis, csv, storage\"\nabstract: \"Regenerates CSV from updated summary_last.json including bench_compare.\"\
    \ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  import tools.export_csv as ex\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      ex.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 262-263: Verified bench artifacts and queued aggregation + CSV to include the bench entry.\n  - Bench 661: BENCH_OK; run_id=5d83d87f; methods=[gd, sd_ls, cg, pcg, scaled_cg].\n    - best_by_resid: pcg_quadratic ≈ 9.99e-07 (iters=682, elapsed≈0.01444s)\n    - fastest_by_elapsed: gd_quadratic elapsed≈0.00322s (resid≈3.13)\n  - Actions:\n    - \"Aggregate After Bench\" -> expect total_entries=9; best-by-resid stays cg_quadratic (~7.98e-07); fastest stays template_n200 (~0.00150s).\n    - \"Export Summary CSV (After Bench)\" -> expect rows=9.\n  - Next:\n    1) Confirm updated summary and CSV.\n    2) Optional scaling sweep (vary n) and brief analysis note.\n```"
