parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Summary/CSV synced to 9 entries including the benchmark. Plan: run a small CG sweep over n to gauge scaling, then log; aggregate/CSV will follow after the sweep completes (to avoid pending-limit and dependency issues).\n\nProceeding to create and submit the CG sweep.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/tools/sweep_cg.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Sweep CG performance across problem sizes n with multiple seeds.\n  Runs experiments.cg_quadratic.run for each (seed, n).\n  Writes:\n    - storage/kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt\n  For aggregator compatibility, top-level 'resid' and 'elapsed' are set to the means.\n  \"\"\"\n  import sys, json, time\n  import numpy as np\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  from utils.io import write_json, write_text\n  from utils.text import short_hash\n  import experiments.cg_quadratic as cg\n\n\
    \  def run_sweep(seeds=(0,1,2), ns=(100,200,400), lam=1e-3, tol=1e-6, max_iter=1000):\n      records = []\n      for n in ns:\n          for seed in seeds:\n              m = cg.run(seed=seed, n=n, lam=lam, tol=tol, max_iter=max_iter)\n              records.append({\"seed\": seed, \"n\": n, **m})\n      # Aggregate by n\n      by_n = {}\n      for r in records:\n          n = int(r[\"n\"])\n          by_n.setdefault(n, []).append(r)\n      summary = {\n          \"ts\": time.time(),\n          \"seeds\": list(seeds),\n          \"ns\": list(ns),\n          \"lam\": lam,\n          \"tol\": tol,\n          \"max_iter\": max_iter,\n          \"entries\": records,\n          \"by_n\": {},\n      }\n      resid_means = []\n      elapsed_means = []\n      for n, rows in by_n.items():\n          resid_arr = np.array([x[\"resid\"] for x in rows], dtype=float)\n          elapsed_arr = np.array([x[\"elapsed\"] for x in rows], dtype=float)\n          iters_arr = np.array([x[\"iters\"] for x in\
    \ rows], dtype=float)\n          summary[\"by_n\"][n] = {\n              \"count\": len(rows),\n              \"resid_mean\": float(resid_arr.mean()),\n              \"resid_std\": float(resid_arr.std()),\n              \"elapsed_mean\": float(elapsed_arr.mean()),\n              \"elapsed_std\": float(elapsed_arr.std()),\n              \"iters_mean\": float(iters_arr.mean()),\n              \"iters_std\": float(iters_arr.std()),\n          }\n          resid_means.append(summary[\"by_n\"][n][\"resid_mean\"])\n          elapsed_means.append(summary[\"by_n\"][n][\"elapsed_mean\"])\n      # Overall means\n      summary[\"resid_mean_overall\"] = float(np.mean(resid_means)) if resid_means else None\n      summary[\"elapsed_mean_overall\"] = float(np.mean(elapsed_means)) if elapsed_means else None\n      # Aggregator compatibility keys\n      summary[\"resid\"] = summary[\"resid_mean_overall\"]\n      summary[\"elapsed\"] = summary[\"elapsed_mean_overall\"]\n      summary[\"tag\"] = \"sweep_cg\"\
    \n      summary[\"run_id\"] = short_hash(json.dumps(summary, sort_keys=True))\n      return summary\n\n  def main():\n      summary = run_sweep(seeds=(0,1,2), ns=(100,200,400), lam=1e-3, tol=1e-6, max_iter=1000)\n      out_path = \"storage/kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json\"\n      write_json(out_path, summary)\n      write_text(\"storage/shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt\", summary[\"run_id\"] + \"\\n\")\n      print(\"SWEEP_OK\")\n      print(\"summary_file:\", out_path)\n      print(\"run_id:\", summary[\"run_id\"])\n      print(\"ns:\", \",\".join(map(str, summary[\"ns\"])))\n      for n in summary[\"ns\"]:\n          bn = summary[\"by_n\"][n]\n          print(f\"n={n} resid_mean={bn['resid_mean']:.3e} elapsed_mean={bn['elapsed_mean']:.6f}s iters_mean={bn['iters_mean']:.1f}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read kairos/tools/sweep_cg.py}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Sweep: CG vs n (100,200,400)\"\ntags: \"analysis,\
    \ sweep, cg, numpy, storage\"\nabstract: \"Runs CG across n in {100,200,400} with seeds {0,1,2}; writes sweep_cg_last_run.json with per-n stats and overall means.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n  import tools.sweep_cg as sweep\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      sweep.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 264-265: Submitted a CG scaling sweep across n.\n  - Added: tools/sweep_cg.py (CG over n∈{100,200,400}, seeds∈{0,1,2}; per-n stats and overall means).\n  - Submission: \"Sweep: CG vs n (100,200,400)\". Expected artifacts:\n    - storage/kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json\n    - storage/shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt\n  - Plan next tick:\n    1) Review sweep results.\n    2) Aggregate + CSV to include sweep entry (top-level resid/elapsed = overall means).\n    3) Write a brief analysis note comparing methods and scaling takeaways.\n```"
