    Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nAGG_OK\nsummary_file: storage/kairos/summary_last.json\nmarker: f86fb402\ntotal_entries: 10\nTABLE: tag | run_id | resid | elapsed | runs\nsweep_cg | 8886af21 | 6.661692378412711e-07 | 0.011932399537828231 | 1\ncg_quadratic | cadd018e | 7.983241867626301e-07 | 0.011696577072143555 | 1\nbench_compare | 5d83d87f | 9.986853188537628e-07 | 0.0032198429107666016 | 1\npcg_quadratic | 7f2d14a5 | 2.2641854337074727e-06 | 0.0270535945892334 | 1\nscaled_cg_quadratic | 0c5dd45e | 1.6400825623770613e-05 | 0.01300954818725586 | 1\ntemplate | 0aabe22c | 0.3152511200894618 | 0.002422809600830078 | 1\ntemplate_batch | 8d06a767 | 0.5471991972996129 | 0.002027082443237305 | 5\ntemplate_n200 | b0ca8e2f | 0.7318398097628631 | 0.0015025138854980469 | 1\nsd_ls_quadratic | 99fab1ee | 3.289283592027506 | 0.009606361389160156 | 1\ngd_quadratic | c76264ff | 3.6297518842596443 | 0.0023055076599121094 | 1\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour\
    \ research submission 'Export Summary CSV (After Sweep)' (ID: 669) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCSV_OK\ncsv_file: storage/kairos/summary_last.csv\nmarker_file: storage/shared/agents/kairos/summary_csv_marker.txt\nrows: 10\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt` (in Research Counter);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n7. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Aggregate After Sweep' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 668.\n- Evaluation 'Export Summary CSV (After Sweep)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 669.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 669 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Sweep) | Kairos I | 266 |\n| 668 |\
    \ 1 | Aggregate After Sweep | Kairos I | 266 |\n| 666 | 1 | Sweep: CG vs n (100,200,400) | Kairos I | 265 |\n| 665 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 264 |\n| 664 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench) | Kairos I | 263 |\n| 663 | 1 | Aggregate After Bench | Kairos I | 263 |\n| 661 | 1 | Bench: GD/SD/CG/PCG/Scaled-CG Compare | Kairos I | 262 |\n| 660 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 261 |\n| 658 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD) | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 657 | 1 | Aggregate After SD | Kairos I | 260 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**kairos/sweep_cg_last_run.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"ts\": 1761199718.5428963,\n  \"seeds\": [\n    0,\n    1,\n    2\n  ],\n  \"ns\": [\n    100,\n    200,\n    400\n  ],\n  \"lam\"\
