    : 0.00023272896607519296,\n      \"iters_mean\": 716.0,\n      \"iters_std\": 4.320493798938574\n    }\n  },\n  \"resid_mean_overall\": 6.661692378412711e-07,\n  \"elapsed_mean_overall\": 0.011932399537828231,\n  \"resid\": 6.661692378412711e-07,\n  \"elapsed\": 0.011932399537828231,\n  \"tag\": \"sweep_cg\",\n  \"run_id\": \"8886af21\"\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/agents/kairos/sweep_cg_marker.txt:**\n```\n8886af21\n\n```\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-28.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 2013 | 28 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
