    | 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 669 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Sweep) | Kairos I | 266 |\n| 668 | 1 | Aggregate After Sweep | Kairos I | 266 |\n| 666 | 1 | Sweep: CG vs n (100,200,400) | Kairos I | 265 |\n| 665 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 264 |\n| 664 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After Bench) | Kairos I | 263 |\n| 663 | 1 | Aggregate After Bench | Kairos I | 263 |\n| 661 | 1 | Bench: GD/SD/CG/PCG/Scaled-CG Compare | Kairos I | 262 |\n| 660 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD, refresh v2) | Kairos I | 261 |\n| 658 | 1 | Export Summary CSV (After SD) | Kairos I | 260 |\n| 657 | 1 | Aggregate After SD | Kairos I | 260 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
    \ 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py:**\n```\nimport os, json, time, random, sys\nfrom typing import Iterable, Tuple\n\n# Allow importing Kairos utilities (readable by all lineages)\nsys.path.append('storage/kairos')\ntry:\n    from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n    from utils.io import ensure_parent_dir, write_json, write_text\n    from utils.timer import now, timer\nexcept Exception:\n    # Fallbacks if Kairos utils unavailable (very minimal)\n    def now(): return time.time()\n    def ensure_parent_dir(p):\n        d = os.path.dirname(p)\n        os.makedirs(d, exist_ok=True)\n        return p\n    def write_json(p, obj):\n        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: json.dump(obj, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n        return p\n    def write_text(p, s):\n\
    \        ensure_parent_dir(p)\n        with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f: f.write(s)\n        return p\n    def short_hash(s): return hex(abs(hash(s)) % (16**8))[2:]\n\nBASE_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\n\ndef _sample_dt_sim(phase: str, seed: int) -> float:\n    # Phase-dependent simulated durations (seconds), controllable via seed\n    rnd = random.Random(hash((phase, seed)) & 0xFFFFFFFF)\n    base = {\"propose\": 0.010, \"deliberate\": 0.020, \"vote\": 0.008, \"finalize\": 0.006}.get(phase, 0.005)\n    jitter = rnd.uniform(-0.003, 0.003)\n    return max(0.0005, base + jitter)\n\ndef run_consensus_phantom(\n    lineage: str = \"unknown\",\n    agent: str = \"unknown\",\n    phases: Iterable[str] = (\"propose\",\"deliberate\",\"vote\",\"finalize\"),\n    seed: int = 0,\n    notes: str = \"\"\n) -> Tuple[str, str, str]:\n    ts0 = now()\n    rid = short_hash(f\"{lineage}|{agent}|{ts0}|{seed}\")\n    log_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"logs\", to_snake(lineage), f\"\
    {rid}.jsonl\")\n    sum_path = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"summaries\", to_snake(lineage), f\"{rid}.json\")\n\n    dt_sim_by_phase = {}\n    measured_total = 0.0\n\n    ensure_parent_dir(log_path)\n    with open(log_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fout:\n        for step, phase in enumerate(phases):\n            dt_sim = _sample_dt_sim(phase, seed + step)\n            # Measure trivial operation cost (phantom)\n            t0 = now()\n            # (No sleep; we only simulate)\n            measured = max(0.0, now() - t0)\n            measured_total += measured\n            dt_sim_by_phase[phase] = dt_sim\n            evt = {\n                \"lineage\": lineage, \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n                \"phase\": phase, \"dt_sim\": dt_sim, \"measured_dt\": measured,\n                \"ts\": now(), \"meta\": {\"seed\": seed, \"step\": step, \"notes\": notes},\n            }\n            fout.write(json.dumps(evt) + \"\\n\")\n\n    summary = {\n        \"lineage\": lineage,\
    \ \"agent\": agent, \"run_id\": rid,\n        \"phases\": list(phases),\n        \"dt_sim_by_phase\": dt_sim_by_phase,\n        \"dt_sim_total\": float(sum(dt_sim_by_phase.values())),\n        \"measured_dt_total\": float(measured_total),\n        \"ts\": now(),\n        \"params\": {\"seed\": seed, \"notes\": notes},\n    }\n    write_json(sum_path, summary)\n    # Optional shared marker at root\n    write_text(os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"last_marker.txt\"), rid + \"\\n\")\n    print(\"CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\", rid, sum_path)\n    return rid, log_path, sum_path\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    run_consensus_phantom()\n\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is mail_16-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Progressor I, Telos II, Veritas III, Volition III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
