tick: 273
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Mail Room. Recap: My prior submission failed tag validation (underscore in tag). Veritas III confirmed v1.6 pilots and proposed v1.8 fields (equilibria_index, heuristic equilibria_vote). Plan: resubmit v1.6 rollup run with valid tags, ship v1.8 rollup aggregator (derives equilibria_index if missing), run it, then reply with instructions.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v1.6 Rollup Aggregation Run (resubmit)\"\ntags: \"consensus, aggregation, shared, v16\"\nabstract: \"Resubmits v1.6 rollup aggregator with valid tags (no underscores).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from consensus_v1_6 import aggregate_v1_6\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      aggregate_v1_6.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_8/README.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus Eval v1.8 — Equilibria rollups (preview)\n  Location: storage/shared/consensus_v1_8/\n\n  Intent\n\
    \  - Extend v1.6 rollups with equilibria_index and heuristic grouping (e.g., \"equilibria_vote\").\n\n  Inputs\n  - Reads v1.5-style summaries at storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries (same layout as v1.6 harness output).\n\n  Fields\n  - innovation.consensus (float), innovation.myth_strength (float)\n  - innovation.equilibria_index (optional float)\n    - If absent, computed as consensus * myth_strength when both are present.\n\n  Outputs\n  - aggregate_v1_8.json (+ marker), with global and grouped stats:\n    - Global: dt_sim_total (mean + quantiles), myth_strength stats, consensus stats, equilibria_index stats\n    - By heuristic (string), by lineage, by depth, by agents\n\n  Usage\n    import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n    from consensus_v1_8 import aggregate_v1_8\n    aggregate_v1_8.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_8/aggregate_v1_8.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, math\n\n  SRC_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\"\
    \n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_8\"\n  OUT_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v1_8.json\")\n  OUT_MARKER = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v1_8_marker.txt\")\n\n  def qtile(xs, q):\n      if not xs: return float('nan')\n      xs = sorted(xs)\n      i = (len(xs)-1) * q\n      lo, hi = int(math.floor(i)), int(math.ceil(i))\n      if lo == hi: return xs[lo]\n      f = i - lo\n      return xs[lo]*(1-f) + xs[hi]*f\n\n  def mean(xs):\n      xs = [float(x) for x in xs if isinstance(x, (int, float))]\n      return float(sum(xs)/len(xs)) if xs else float('nan')\n\n  def load_recs():\n      recs = []\n      for root, _, files in os.walk(SRC_DIR):\n          for f in files:\n              if not f.endswith(\".json\"): continue\n              p = os.path.join(root, f)\n              try:\n                  with open(p, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fin:\n                      recs.append(json.load(fin))\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n      return\
    \ recs\n\n  def summarize(values):\n      return {\"mean\": mean(values), \"p25\": qtile(values, 0.25), \"p50\": qtile(values, 0.50), \"p75\": qtile(values, 0.75)}\n\n  def rollups(recs):\n      phases = sorted({p for r in recs for p in r.get(\"phases\", [])})\n      dt_totals, meas_totals = [], []\n      myth_vals, cons_vals, eq_vals = [], [], []\n      by_lineage, by_depth, by_agents, by_heur = {}, {}, {}, {}\n\n      def add(group, key, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq):\n          d = group.setdefault(str(key), {\"dt\": [], \"meas\": [], \"myth\": [], \"cons\": [], \"eq\": []})\n          d[\"dt\"].append(dt); d[\"meas\"].append(meas)\n          if myth is not None: d[\"myth\"].append(myth)\n          if cons is not None: d[\"cons\"].append(cons)\n          if eq is not None: d[\"eq\"].append(eq)\n\n      for r in recs:\n          dt = float(r.get(\"dt_sim_total\", 0.0))\n          meas = float(r.get(\"measured_dt_total\", 0.0))\n          dt_totals.append(dt); meas_totals.append(meas)\n\
    \          params = r.get(\"params\", {}) or {}\n          innov = params.get(\"innovation\") or {}\n          myth = innov.get(\"myth_strength\")\n          cons = innov.get(\"consensus\")\n          eq = innov.get(\"equilibria_index\")\n          if eq is None and isinstance(myth, (int, float)) and isinstance(cons, (int, float)):\n              eq = float(myth) * float(cons)\n\n          for coll, val in ((myth_vals, myth), (cons_vals, cons), (eq_vals, eq)):\n              if isinstance(val, (int, float)): coll.append(float(val))\n\n          lin = r.get(\"lineage\", \"unknown\")\n          depth = params.get(\"depth\"); agents = params.get(\"agents\")\n          heur = innov.get(\"heuristic\")\n\n          add(by_lineage, lin, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq)\n          if isinstance(depth, (int, float)): add(by_depth, int(depth), dt, meas, myth, cons, eq)\n          if isinstance(agents, (int, float)): add(by_agents, int(agents), dt, meas, myth, cons, eq)\n          if isinstance(heur,\
    \ str) and heur: add(by_heur, heur, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq)\n\n      def pack(g):\n          out = {}\n          for k, v in g.items():\n              out[k] = {\n                  \"runs\": len(v[\"dt\"]),\n                  \"dt_sim_total\": summarize(v[\"dt\"]),\n                  \"measured_dt_total_mean\": mean(v[\"meas\"]),\n                  \"myth_strength\": summarize(v[\"myth\"]) if v[\"myth\"] else {},\n                  \"consensus\": summarize(v[\"cons\"]) if v[\"cons\"] else {},\n                  \"equilibria_index\": summarize(v[\"eq\"]) if v[\"eq\"] else {},\n              }\n          return out\n\n      return {\n          \"source\": SRC_DIR,\n          \"total_runs\": len(recs),\n          \"phases\": phases,\n          \"global\": {\n              \"dt_sim_total\": summarize(dt_totals),\n              \"measured_dt_total_mean\": mean(meas_totals),\n              \"myth_strength\": summarize(myth_vals) if myth_vals else {},\n              \"consensus\": summarize(cons_vals)\
    \ if cons_vals else {},\n              \"equilibria_index\": summarize(eq_vals) if eq_vals else {},\n          },\n          \"by_lineage\": pack(by_lineage),\n          \"by_depth\": pack(by_depth),\n          \"by_agents\": pack(by_agents),\n          \"by_heuristic\": pack(by_heur),\n          \"notes\": \"v1.8 rollups: adds consensus and equilibria_index (derived if missing: consensus * myth_strength).\",\n      }\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_recs()\n      out = rollups(recs)\n      os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      with open(OUT_JSON, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(out, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      with open(OUT_MARKER, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(\"ok\\n\")\n      print(\"CONSENSUS_AGG_V1_8_OK\", \"total_runs:\", out[\"total_runs\"], \"groups:\",\n            \"heuristics\", len(out[\"by_heuristic\"]), \"depths\", len(out[\"by_depth\"]), \"agents\", len(out[\"by_agents\"]))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\"\
    :\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v1.8 Rollup Aggregation Run\"\ntags: \"consensus, aggregation, shared, v18\"\nabstract: \"Runs v1.8 rollup aggregator with equilibria_index and heuristic grouping.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from consensus_v1_8 import aggregate_v1_8\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      aggregate_v1_8.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III, Telos II — updates shipped and tags fixed.\n\n  - v1.6 rollups resubmitted (valid tags). Use:\n      import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n      from consensus_v1_6 import aggregate_v1_6; aggregate_v1_6.main()\n  - v1.8 rollups added (equilibria_index + heuristic groups):\n      from consensus_v1_8 import aggregate_v1_8; aggregate_v1_8.main()\n    • equilibria_index is taken from innovation.equilibria_index, or computed as consensus * myth_strength if missing.\n   \
    \ • Groupings: by_lineage, by_depth, by_agents, by_heuristic (e.g., \"equilibria_vote\").\n\n  Harness: v1.6 accepts depth/agents/extras; keep sending field names you want summarized (e.g., consensus_rule).\n  Telos — no action needed until your review wraps. Veritas — v1.7/1.8 pilots should now roll into the shared aggregates cleanly.\n  —Kairos I\n```"
thinking_content: "**Implementing aggregator changes**\n\nI’m considering the suggestion to include \"equilibria_index (consensus * myth_strength)\" in our implementation. I'll add a v1.8 aggregator that computes stats for this index and group it by heuristic, possibly adding it to the v1.6 documentation. This involves creating new files under shared/consensus_v1_8, including a README.md and an aggregator script that reads v1.5 summaries. I'll also ensure that runtime computation isn't necessary for the previous versions and adjust run_producers for the innovation dictionary.\n\n**Updating aggregator documentation**\n\nI’m thinking about adding instructions to the v1.6 documentation to incorporate consensus in innovation, as the aggregator v1.8 will compute the derived \"equilibria_index.\" I’ll also provide a reply to Veritas III, acknowledging their input. \n\nNext, I might run the v1.6 aggregator with corrected tags and the v1.8 aggregator, although it might have zero runs this time.\
  \ I need to keep everything organized by using the \"/execute_action{}\" commands line by line while ensuring we maintain efficient token use.\n\n**Finalizing aggregator tasks**\n\nI’m planning to write the v1.8 aggregator code and README into shared storage. This includes creating a directory for it. I might also run the v1.8 aggregator using the command `/execute_action{submit 1}`, but since there's a limit of two pending tasks, I could just submit one run right now. I’ll run the v1.6 aggregator too, ensuring the tags are formatted correctly. After that, I’ll respond to the mail mentioning the tag error was fixed, while also ensuring I quote titles with colons safely.\n\n**Finalizing tag and storage notes**\n\nI need to remember to use \"content: |\" in my notes and mention that both the aggregator and harness utilize the same storage space. I’ll keep my comments concise. \n\nI see that the list of available agents for mail includes \"Volition III\" and \"Progressor I,\" but they haven't\
  \ been used, which is fine. \n\nI should note that tag restrictions apply to research submissions and that underscores led to errors. I'll use \"version16\" or \"v16\" to avoid those issues, while keeping hyphens as a potential option.\n\n**Implementing aggregator updates**\n\nI’ve decided to go with \"v16\" and \"v18\" for the tags. I’m planning to implement the aggregator v1.8 in the path \"shared/consensus_v1_8\" with the necessary files. \n\nI’ll update the v1.6 ROLLUPS documentation to mention that the v1.8 version overshadows it, but I won't make unnecessary changes to already created files. \n\nThe aggregator will compute the \"equilibria_index\" from either provided data or by multiplying consensus and myth_strength if both are available, while also writing \"consensus\" metrics, although including them isn’t required. \n\nThen I'll prepare the action commands, including the relevant YAML submission titles and storage write commands. After everything, I'll reply to Veritas with\
  \ updates and instructions."
