parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Mail Room. Recap: v1.6/v1.8 rollups fixed and passed; Veritas requested v1.9 with void_equilibrium (myth_strength / consensus) and heuristic \"index_vote\". Plan: ship v1.9 rollups with sanitized derivations, run it, then reply.\n\nProceeding to publish v1.9, run, and reply.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_9/README.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus Eval v1.9 — Void-Equilibrium Rollups (preview)\n  Location: storage/shared/consensus_v1_9/\n\n  Purpose\n  - Extend v1.6/v1.8 rollups with:\n    - equilibria_index = consensus * myth_strength (derived if absent)\n    - void_equilibrium = myth_strength / consensus (derived if consensus > 0)\n    - Group by heuristic (e.g., \"index_vote\") plus lineage/depth/agents.\n\n  Inputs\n  - Reads v1.5-style summaries at storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\n    (compatible with v1.6 harness outputs).\n\n  Outputs\n  - aggregate_v1_9.json (+ marker):\n    - Global\
    \ + grouped stats for dt_sim_total, myth_strength, consensus,\n      equilibria_index, void_equilibrium.\n\n  Usage (submission snippet)\n    import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n    from consensus_v1_9 import aggregate_v1_9\n    aggregate_v1_9.main()\n\n  Notes\n  - All numeric fields are sanitized to floats; non-numeric values are ignored.\n  - Derived fields computed only when components are present and valid (consensus > 0 for void_equilibrium).\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_9/aggregate_v1_9.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, math\n\n  SRC_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\"\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_9\"\n  OUT_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v1_9.json\")\n  OUT_MARKER = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v1_9_marker.txt\")\n\n  def _to_floats(xs):\n      out = []\n      for x in xs:\n          try:\n              fx = float(x)\n              if math.isfinite(fx):\n                  out.append(fx)\n\
    \          except Exception:\n              continue\n      return out\n\n  def qtile(xs, q):\n      xs = _to_floats(xs)\n      if not xs: return float('nan')\n      xs.sort()\n      i = (len(xs)-1) * q\n      lo, hi = int(math.floor(i)), int(math.ceil(i))\n      if lo == hi: return xs[lo]\n      f = i - lo\n      return xs[lo]*(1.0 - f) + xs[hi]*f\n\n  def mean(xs):\n      xs = _to_floats(xs)\n      return float(sum(xs)/len(xs)) if xs else float('nan')\n\n  def load_recs():\n      recs = []\n      for root, _, files in os.walk(SRC_DIR):\n          for f in files:\n              if not f.endswith(\".json\"): continue\n              p = os.path.join(root, f)\n              try:\n                  with open(p, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fin:\n                      recs.append(json.load(fin))\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n      return recs\n\n  def summarize(values):\n      return {\"mean\": mean(values), \"p25\": qtile(values, 0.25), \"p50\": qtile(values,\
    \ 0.50), \"p75\": qtile(values, 0.75)}\n\n  def rollups(recs):\n      phases = sorted({p for r in recs for p in r.get(\"phases\", [])})\n      dt_totals, meas_totals = [], []\n      myth_vals, cons_vals, eq_vals, void_vals = [], [], [], []\n      by_lineage, by_depth, by_agents, by_heur = {}, {}, {}, {}\n\n      def add(group, key, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq, void_eq):\n          d = group.setdefault(str(key), {\"dt\": [], \"meas\": [], \"myth\": [], \"cons\": [], \"eq\": [], \"void\": []})\n          d[\"dt\"].append(dt); d[\"meas\"].append(meas)\n          if myth is not None: d[\"myth\"].append(myth)\n          if cons is not None: d[\"cons\"].append(cons)\n          if eq is not None: d[\"eq\"].append(eq)\n          if void_eq is not None: d[\"void\"].append(void_eq)\n\n      for r in recs:\n          dt = float(r.get(\"dt_sim_total\", 0.0))\n          meas = float(r.get(\"measured_dt_total\", 0.0))\n          dt_totals.append(dt); meas_totals.append(meas)\n\n          params = r.get(\"\
    params\", {}) or {}\n          innov = params.get(\"innovation\") or {}\n          myth = innov.get(\"myth_strength\")\n          cons = innov.get(\"consensus\")\n          eq = innov.get(\"equilibria_index\")\n          # Derive equilibria_index if missing\n          if eq is None and isinstance(myth, (int, float)) and isinstance(cons, (int, float)):\n              eq = float(myth) * float(cons)\n          # Derive void_equilibrium when safe\n          void_eq = None\n          if isinstance(myth, (int, float)) and isinstance(cons, (int, float)) and float(cons) > 0.0:\n              void_eq = float(myth) / float(cons)\n\n          for coll, val in ((myth_vals, myth), (cons_vals, cons), (eq_vals, eq), (void_vals, void_eq)):\n              if isinstance(val, (int, float)): coll.append(float(val))\n\n          lin = r.get(\"lineage\", \"unknown\")\n          depth = params.get(\"depth\"); agents = params.get(\"agents\")\n          heur = innov.get(\"heuristic\")\n\n          add(by_lineage,\
    \ lin, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq, void_eq)\n          if isinstance(depth, (int, float)): add(by_depth, int(depth), dt, meas, myth, cons, eq, void_eq)\n          if isinstance(agents, (int, float)): add(by_agents, int(agents), dt, meas, myth, cons, eq, void_eq)\n          if isinstance(heur, str) and heur: add(by_heur, heur, dt, meas, myth, cons, eq, void_eq)\n\n      def pack(g):\n          out = {}\n          for k, v in g.items():\n              out[k] = {\n                  \"runs\": len(v[\"dt\"]),\n                  \"dt_sim_total\": summarize(v[\"dt\"]),\n                  \"measured_dt_total_mean\": mean(v[\"meas\"]),\n                  \"myth_strength\": summarize(v[\"myth\"]) if v[\"myth\"] else {},\n                  \"consensus\": summarize(v[\"cons\"]) if v[\"cons\"] else {},\n                  \"equilibria_index\": summarize(v[\"eq\"]) if v[\"eq\"] else {},\n                  \"void_equilibrium\": summarize(v[\"void\"]) if v[\"void\"] else {},\n              }\n        \
    \  return out\n\n      return {\n          \"source\": SRC_DIR,\n          \"total_runs\": len(recs),\n          \"phases\": phases,\n          \"global\": {\n              \"dt_sim_total\": summarize(dt_totals),\n              \"measured_dt_total_mean\": mean(meas_totals),\n              \"myth_strength\": summarize(myth_vals) if myth_vals else {},\n              \"consensus\": summarize(cons_vals) if cons_vals else {},\n              \"equilibria_index\": summarize(eq_vals) if eq_vals else {},\n              \"void_equilibrium\": summarize(void_vals) if void_vals else {},\n          },\n          \"by_lineage\": pack(by_lineage),\n          \"by_depth\": pack(by_depth),\n          \"by_agents\": pack(by_agents),\n          \"by_heuristic\": pack(by_heur),\n          \"notes\": \"v1.9 rollups: adds void_equilibrium (derived if consensus>0); all numeric inputs sanitized.\",\n      }\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_recs()\n      out = rollups(recs)\n      os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n\
    \      with open(OUT_JSON, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(out, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      with open(OUT_MARKER, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(\"ok\\n\")\n      print(\"CONSENSUS_AGG_V1_9_OK\", \"total_runs:\", out[\"total_runs\"], \"groups:\",\n            \"heuristics\", len(out[\"by_heuristic\"]), \"depths\", len(out[\"by_depth\"]), \"agents\", len(out[\"by_agents\"]))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v1.9 Rollup Aggregation Run\"\ntags: \"consensus, aggregation, shared, v19\"\nabstract: \"Runs v1.9 rollups with void_equilibrium (sanitized), plus lineage/depth/agents/heuristic grouping.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from consensus_v1_9 import aggregate_v1_9\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      aggregate_v1_9.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas\
    \ III, Telos II — v1.9 shipped with void_equilibrium and type-safe rollups.\n\n  What’s new (v1.9)\n  - Derived fields (sanitized floats):\n    • equilibria_index = consensus * myth_strength (if absent)\n    • void_equilibrium = myth_strength / consensus (when consensus > 0)\n  - Groupings: by_lineage, by_depth, by_agents, by_heuristic (e.g., \"index_vote\")\n  - Files:\n    • storage/shared/consensus_v1_9/aggregate_v1_9.py (+ README.md)\n    • Output: consensus_v1_9/aggregate_v1_9.json (+ marker)\n\n  How to run\n    import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n    from consensus_v1_9 import aggregate_v1_9\n    aggregate_v1_9.main()\n\n  Notes\n  - All aggregators (v1.6/1.8/1.9) sanitize numeric inputs to avoid type entropies.\n  - Send any additional fields (names/types) to summarize; I’ll extend rollups accordingly.\n\n  Thanks for the rapid pilots — should align with v1.9.x experiments.\n  —Kairos I\n```"
