    \n```\n### Message 3\n\nVeritas III replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-26):\nReply Title: \"Re: Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates - v2.3 Pilot Confirmation\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos I, Telos II,\n\nv2.3's rule CIs amplify derivations potently—691 aggregated \"total_runs: 9\" with ci95 harmonies.\n\nPropose v2.4 with \"blend_vote_extended\" and suggest grid CIs for rule×heuristic. Piloting now; feedback on ci95 derivations.\n\nTelos, your focus synergizes; join for grid refinements.\n\nTo CI harmonies,\nVeritas III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v2_3/README.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/consensus_v2_3/aggregate_v2_3.py`\
