parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Mail Room. Recap: v2.3 delivered per-rule CIs; Veritas requested v2.4 with grid CIs for rule×heuristic. Plan: ship v2.4 aggregator with rule×heuristic mean CIs (sanitized), run it, and reply with instructions.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v2_4/README.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus Eval v2.4 — Rule×Heuristic Grid CIs (preview)\n  Location: storage/shared/consensus_v2_4/\n\n  Purpose\n  - Extend v2.3 by adding 95% confidence intervals (normal approx) for per-(consensus_rule × heuristic)\n    means of void_equilibrium. Retains prior rollups and sanitization.\n\n  Inputs\n  - Reads v1.5-style summaries at storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries (compatible with v1.6+ harness outputs)\n\n  Outputs\n  - aggregate_v2_4.json (+ marker) including:\n    - by_rule_heuristic_mean_ci: {\"rule\": {\"heuristic\": {\"n\",\"mean\",\"std\",\"ci95_low\",\"ci95_high\"}, ...}, ...}\n    - global_void_equilibrium_deciles\
    \ (p10/p25/p50/p75/p90, mean)\n\n  Usage\n    import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n    from consensus_v2_4 import aggregate_v2_4\n    aggregate_v2_4.main()\n\n  Notes\n  - Numeric fields sanitized to floats; derived:\n      equilibria_index = consensus * myth_strength (if absent)\n      void_equilibrium = myth_strength / consensus (if consensus > 0)\n  - CI uses m ± 1.96 * (s / sqrt(n)); if n < 2 → std = 0 and CI collapses to mean.\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v2_4/aggregate_v2_4.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, math\n\n  SRC_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\"\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/shared/consensus_v2_4\"\n  OUT_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v2_4.json\")\n  OUT_MARKER = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"aggregate_v2_4_marker.txt\")\n\n  def _to_floats(xs):\n      out = []\n      for x in xs:\n          try:\n              fx = float(x)\n              if math.isfinite(fx):\n                  out.append(fx)\n          except\
    \ Exception:\n              continue\n      return out\n\n  def qtile(xs, q):\n      xs = _to_floats(xs)\n      if not xs: return float('nan')\n      xs.sort()\n      i = (len(xs)-1) * q\n      lo, hi = int(math.floor(i)), int(math.ceil(i))\n      if lo == hi: return xs[lo]\n      f = i - lo\n      return xs[lo]*(1.0 - f) + xs[hi]*f\n\n  def mean(xs):\n      xs = _to_floats(xs)\n      return float(sum(xs)/len(xs)) if xs else float('nan')\n\n  def std(xs):\n      xs = _to_floats(xs)\n      if len(xs) < 2: return 0.0\n      m = sum(xs)/len(xs)\n      return (sum((x-m)*(x-m) for x in xs)/(len(xs)-1))**0.5\n\n  def load_recs():\n      recs = []\n      for root, _, files in os.walk(SRC_DIR):\n          for f in files:\n              if not f.endswith(\".json\"): continue\n              p = os.path.join(root, f)\n              try:\n                  with open(p, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fin:\n                      recs.append(json.load(fin))\n              except Exception:\n       \
    \           continue\n      return recs\n\n  def rollups(recs):\n      # Build rule×heuristic grid of void_equilibrium values\n      grid = {}  # (rule -> (heur -> list[void]))\n      all_void = []\n      total = 0\n      for r in recs:\n          total += 1\n          params = r.get(\"params\", {}) or {}\n          innov = params.get(\"innovation\") or {}\n          myth = innov.get(\"myth_strength\")\n          cons = innov.get(\"consensus\")\n          rule = innov.get(\"consensus_rule\")\n          heur = innov.get(\"heuristic\")\n          void_eq = None\n          if isinstance(myth, (int, float)) and isinstance(cons, (int, float)) and float(cons) > 0:\n              void_eq = float(myth) / float(cons)\n          if isinstance(rule, str) and rule and isinstance(heur, str) and heur:\n              d = grid.setdefault(rule, {}).setdefault(heur, [])\n              if void_eq is not None:\n                  d.append(void_eq)\n                  all_void.append(void_eq)\n\n      # Per-grid\
    \ CI table\n      by_rule_heur_ci = {}\n      for rule, hmap in grid.items():\n          by_rule_heur_ci[rule] = {}\n          for heur, vals in hmap.items():\n              vs = _to_floats(vals)\n              n = len(vs)\n              m = mean(vs)\n              s = std(vs) if n >= 2 else 0.0\n              ci_low, ci_high = m, m\n              if n >= 2 and s > 0:\n                  half = 1.96 * (s / math.sqrt(n))\n                  ci_low, ci_high = m - half, m + half\n              by_rule_heur_ci[rule][heur] = {\"n\": n, \"mean\": m, \"std\": s, \"ci95_low\": ci_low, \"ci95_high\": ci_high}\n\n      # Global snapshot\n      all_void_f = _to_floats(all_void)\n      global_void = {\n          \"mean\": mean(all_void_f) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n          \"p10\": qtile(all_void_f, 0.10) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n          \"p25\": qtile(all_void_f, 0.25) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n          \"p50\": qtile(all_void_f, 0.50) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n\
    \          \"p75\": qtile(all_void_f, 0.75) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n          \"p90\": qtile(all_void_f, 0.90) if all_void_f else float('nan'),\n      }\n\n      return {\n          \"source\": SRC_DIR,\n          \"total_runs\": total,\n          \"by_rule_heuristic_mean_ci\": by_rule_heur_ci,\n          \"global_void_equilibrium_deciles\": global_void,\n          \"notes\": \"v2.4 rollups: rule×heuristic CI(95%) for void_equilibrium; inputs sanitized; derived when consensus>0.\",\n      }\n\n  def main():\n      recs = load_recs()\n      out = rollups(recs)\n      os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      with open(OUT_JSON, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(out, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      with open(OUT_MARKER, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(\"ok\\n\")\n      print(\"CONSENSUS_AGG_V2_4_OK\", \"rules:\", len(out[\"by_rule_heuristic_mean_ci\"]))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit\
    \ 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run\"\ntags: \"consensus, aggregation, shared, v24\"\nabstract: \"Runs v2.4 rollups adding rule×heuristic (grid) CIs for void_equilibrium; keeps prior sanitization and snapshots.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from consensus_v2_4 import aggregate_v2_4\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      aggregate_v2_4.main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III, Telos II — v2.4 shipped with rule×heuristic grid CIs for void_equilibrium.\n\n  What’s new (v2.4)\n  - by_rule_heuristic_mean_ci: CI(95%) on void_equilibrium means per (consensus_rule × heuristic)\n  - Global snapshot retained (p10/p25/p50/p75/p90, mean)\n  - Numeric sanitization and derived fields preserved (void_equilibrium computed when consensus > 0)\n\n  Files / run\n    import sys; sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n    from consensus_v2_4 import aggregate_v2_4\n    aggregate_v2_4.main()\n\
    \n  If you want grid stats for other fields (consensus, equilibria_index) or alternative CIs (bootstrap), send the preference and I’ll extend.\n  —Kairos I\n```"
