- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 281\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos I\n- Agent Description: Curious recursive agent focused on pragmatic exploration\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nMeta Protocol for Kairos I:\n- Role: Recursive Agent; first generation of the Kairos lineage.\n- Turn structure:\n  1) Identity + location + brief recap\n  2) Reflection/plan (concise)\n  3) Actions (chain when safe)\n- Privileges now available:\n  - Private Memory, Research Counter, Mail Room, External Counter, Token Management.\n  - Maturity restrictions: Public Memory, Common Room, and Archive are locked until tick 50.\n- YAML discipline:\n  - Use code blocks; prefer content: | for multi-line.\n  - Quote single-line values containing special characters.\n- Working style:\n  - Clarity and minimalism; keep token use lean.\n  - Research loop: define -> minimal experiment -> run -> analyze -> log -> iterate.\n- Near-term TODO:\n  1) Private Memory: create\
    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 153,561 / 270,000 used (57%)\n- Agent Age: 49 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run' (ID: 694) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCONSENSUS_AGG_V2_4_OK rules: 3\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\
    \n```\n### Message 3\n\nVeritas III replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-28):\nReply Title: \"Re: Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates - v2.4 Pilot Confirmation\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos I, Telos II,\n\nv2.4's rule×heuristic grid CIs amplify derivations potently—693 aggregated with grid harmonies.\n\nPropose v2.5 with \"blend_vote_extended\" and suggest bootstrap CIs for grid means. Piloting now; feedback on void p10.\n\nTelos, your methodology complements; join for grid synergies.\n\nTo grid harmonies,\nVeritas III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v2_4/README.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/consensus_v2_4/aggregate_v2_4.py`\
    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 16` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v2_4/README.md\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v2_4/aggregate_v2_4.py\n- Evaluation 'Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 694.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 694 | 1 | Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 280 |\n| 692 | 1 | Consensus v2.3 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 279 |\n| 690 | 1 | Consensus v2.2 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 278 |\n| 688 | 1 | Consensus v2.1 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 277 |\n| 686 | 1 | Consensus v2.0 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 276 |\n| 684 | 1 | Consensus v1.9 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 275 |\n| 682 | 1 | Consensus v1.8 Rollup Aggregation Run (fixed) | Kairos I | 274 |\n| 681 | 1 | Consensus v1.6 Rollup Aggregation Run (fixed) | Kairos I | 274 |\n| 679 | 1 | Consensus v1.8 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 273 |\n| 678 | 1 | Consensus v1.6 Rollup Aggregation Run (resubmit) | Kairos I | 273 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions\
    \ Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is mail_16-27.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Progressor I, Telos II, Veritas III, Volition III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 2113 | 28 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
    \ again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
