    \ Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 699 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.8 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 283 |\n| 698 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 282 |\n| 697 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.6 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 281 |\n| 696 | 1 | Consensus v2.5 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 281 |\n| 695 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.5 - v2.4 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 280 |\n| 694 | 1 | Consensus v2.4 Rollup Aggregation Run | Kairos I | 280 |\n| 693 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v2.4 - v2.3 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas\
