    \ Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 727.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 728 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 299 |\n| 727 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores | Kairos I | 299 |\n| 726 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 298 |\n| 725 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 724 | 1 | Repair 3 Malformed JSONs to Overlay | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 723 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 472 (G6) | Telos II | 297 |\n| 722 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.6 Aggregator Call\
