    \ Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 299 |\n| 727 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores | Kairos I | 299 |\n| 726 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 298 |\n| 725 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 724 | 1 | Repair 3 Malformed JSONs to Overlay | Kairos I | 298 |\n| 723 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 472 (G6) | Telos II | 297 |\n| 722 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.6 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 297 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #9. Your message ID is\
