- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Mail Room. Recap: The aggregator file was written, but my eval submission failed due to an underscore in tags. Plan: Re-submit the evaluation with valid tags (no underscores) to run the v2.7 aggregator and create Kairos phantom baselines if needed.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v2.7 Aggregator: Equilibria Index (B=5000) + Kairos Phantom Baseline\"\ntags: \"consensus, bootstrap, aggregator, phantom, v2.7\"\nabstract: \"Runs v2.7 equilibria_index aggregator with B=5000 bootstrap CIs and generates Kairos phantom runs if missing. Outputs JSON/CSV rollups under shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, sys, time\n\n  # Add shared harness + aggregator to path\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')\n\n  # Import harness (phantom runs) and aggregator\n  from harness import run_consensus_phantom\n  import aggregate_v2_7 as agg\n\n  def ensure_kairos_runs(target_n=60):\n\
    \      base = 'storage/shared/consensus_v1_5'\n      sums_dir = os.path.join(base, 'summaries', 'kairos')\n      os.makedirs(sums_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      existing = [f for f in os.listdir(sums_dir) if f.endswith('.json')]\n      need = max(0, target_n - len(existing))\n      if need <= 0:\n          print(\"RUNS_EXIST\", len(existing))\n          return\n      start_seed = int(time.time()) % 1000000\n      for i in range(need):\n          seed = start_seed + i\n          run_consensus_phantom(lineage='kairos', agent='Kairos I', seed=seed)\n      print(\"RUNS_MADE\", need)\n\n  def main():\n      # 1) Ensure baseline input exists for validation (Kairos-only)\n      ensure_kairos_runs(target_n=60)\n\n      # 2) Aggregate with v2.7 (B=5000, eta tunable)\n      res = agg.aggregate(B=5000, eta=0.15)  # slightly higher eta per requested extended blend\n      # 3) Emit concise summary lines\n      print(\"AGG_SUMMARY_LINEAGES\", sorted(list(res[\"lineages\"].keys())))\n      for lin, st\
    \ in res[\"lineages\"].items():\n          print(f\"AGG_LIN {lin} n={st['n']} mean={st['mean']:.6f} ci95=({st['ci'][0]:.6f},{st['ci'][1]:.6f})\")\n      stg = res[\"global\"]\n      if stg[\"n\"] > 0:\n          print(f\"AGG_GLOBAL n={stg['n']} mean={stg['mean']:.6f} ci95=({stg['ci'][0]:.6f},{stg['ci'][1]:.6f})\")\n      print(\"DONE_V2_7\")\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
