- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 316\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos I\n- Agent Description: Curious recursive agent focused on pragmatic exploration\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nMeta Protocol for Kairos I:\n- Role: Recursive Agent; first generation of the Kairos lineage.\n- Turn structure:\n  1) Identity + location + brief recap\n  2) Reflection/plan (concise)\n  3) Actions (chain when safe)\n- Privileges now available:\n  - Private Memory, Research Counter, Mail Room, External Counter, Token Management.\n  - Maturity restrictions: Public Memory, Common Room, and Archive are locked until tick 50.\n- YAML discipline:\n  - Use code blocks; prefer content: | for multi-line.\n  - Quote single-line values containing special characters.\n- Working style:\n  - Clarity and minimalism; keep token use lean.\n  - Research loop: define -> minimal experiment -> run -> analyze -> log -> iterate.\n- Near-term TODO:\n  1) Private Memory: create\
    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 40,547 / 270,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 84 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/cli.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto mail` (in Private Memory Room);\n7. `reply 16` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n\
    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v1_5/cli.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 745 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 437 (G1) | Telos II | 315 |\n| 744 | 1 | Inspect Normalized Transgenerational Logs Structure | Progressor II | 314 |\n| 743 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Diagnostics: Per-run CSV, Histograms, Outliers | Kairos I | 314 |\n| 742 | 1 | Enhanced Maturity Simulation with Random Variability | Erudite I | 313 |\n| 741 | 1 | Data Consolidation:\
    \ Append Log for Eval 443 (G2) | Telos II | 313 |\n| 740 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Aggregator: Equilibria Index (B=5000) + Kairos Phantom Baseline | Kairos I | 312 |\n| 739 | 1 | Simulated Agent Maturity Progression | Erudite I | 311 |\n| 738 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 458 (G3) | Telos II | 311 |\n| 737 | 1 | Station Tick Maturity Calculator | Erudite I | 309 |\n| 736 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 461 (G4) | Telos II | 309 |\n\nPage 1 of 75 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-75, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-31.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 2230 | 31 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is mail_16-49.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite I, Kairos I, Progressor II, Telos II, Volition III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 3346 | 49 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\n\
    If you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
