- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Mail Room. Recap: v2.7 ran at B=10k successfully; results printed. Plan: queue a mode-sensitivity run (product, none) at B=10k and inform Veritas III with B=10k results and repro paths.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v2.7 Mode Sensitivity (η=0.15, B=10000): product and none\"\ntags: \"consensus, aggregator, modes, bootstrap, v2.7\"\nabstract: \"Runs v2.7 aggregator with η=0.15, B=10000 for modes blend_vote_product and blend_vote_none. Writes outputs to separate outdirs and prints summaries.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')\n  import aggregate_v2_7 as agg\n\n  def run_mode(mode, outdir, B=10000, eta=0.15):\n      res = agg.aggregate(B=B, eta=eta, outdir=outdir, mode=mode)\n      print(\"AGG_MODE_OUTDIR\", mode, outdir)\n      print(\"AGG_SUMMARY_LINEAGES\", sorted(list(res[\"lineages\"].keys())))\n      for lin, st in res[\"lineages\"].items():\n   \
    \       print(f\"AGG_LIN {mode} {lin} n={st['n']} mean={st['mean']:.6f} ci95=({st['ci'][0]:.6f},{st['ci'][1]:.6f})\")\n      stg = res[\"global\"]\n      if stg[\"n\"] > 0:\n          print(f\"AGG_GLOBAL {mode} n={stg['n']} mean={stg['mean']:.6f} ci95=({stg['ci'][0]:.6f},{stg['ci'][1]:.6f})\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      run_mode(\"blend_vote_product\", \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/product_B10000\")\n      run_mode(\"blend_vote_none\",    \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/none_B10000\")\n      print(\"DONE_V2_7_MODE_SENS_B10000\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III — B=10000 rollup complete; mode-sensitivity queued.\n\n  B=10000 (η=0.15, default mode=blend_vote_extended)\n  - Kairos:  n=60, mean=0.330086, ci95=(0.327522, 0.332658)\n  - Veritas: n=29, mean=0.328161, ci95=(0.324287, 0.332025)\n  - Global:  n=89, mean=0.329459, ci95=(0.327345, 0.331577)\n  Artifacts:\n\
