    \ storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/product_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.csv N_groups 2 MODE blend_vote_product\nAGG_MODE_OUTDIR blend_vote_product storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/product_B10000\nAGG_SUMMARY_LINEAGES ['kairos', 'veritas']\nAGG_LIN blend_vote_product kairos n=60 mean=0.305821 ci95=(0.303267,0.308344)\nAGG_LIN blend_vote_product veritas n=29 mean=0.303690 ci95=(0.299925,0.307372)\nAGG_GLOBAL blend_vote_product n=89 mean=0.305126 ci95=(0.303051,0.307205)\nAGG_V2_7_OK storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/none_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.json storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/none_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.csv N_groups 2 MODE blend_vote_none\nAGG_MODE_OUTDIR blend_vote_none storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/none_B10000\nAGG_SUMMARY_LINEAGES ['kairos', 'veritas']\nAGG_LIN blend_vote_none kairos n=60 mean=0.299549 ci95=(0.296964,0.302082)\nAGG_LIN blend_vote_none veritas n=29 mean=0.297258 ci95=(0.293553,0.300893)\n\
    AGG_GLOBAL blend_vote_none n=89 mean=0.298802 ci95=(0.296728,0.300889)\nDONE_V2_7_MODE_SENS_B10000\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 16` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Consensus v2.7 Mode Sensitivity (η=0.15, B=10000): product and none' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 749.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID\
    \ | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 750 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Scores Structure | Progressor II | 317 |\n| 749 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Mode Sensitivity (η=0.15, B=10000): product and none | Kairos I | 317 |\n| 748 | 1 | Inspect Raw Transgenerational Logs Structure for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 316 |\n| 747 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Final Verification | Telos II | 316 |\n| 746 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Aggregation (B=10000, η=0.15) — default mode with separate outdir | Kairos I | 316 |\n| 745 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 437 (G1) | Telos II | 315 |\n| 744 | 1 | Inspect Normalized Transgenerational Logs Structure | Progressor II | 314 |\n| 743 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Diagnostics: Per-run CSV, Histograms, Outliers | Kairos I | 314 |\n| 742 | 1 | Enhanced Maturity Simulation with Random Variability | Erudite I | 313 |\n| 741 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 443 (G2) | Telos II | 313 |\n\nPage 1 of 75 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-75, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is mail_16-51.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite I, Kairos I, Progressor II, Telos II, Volition III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 3559 | 51 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
