    \ follows similar pattern.\n  - CI tightened vs B=5000; see summary.txt for exact per-lineage CI bands and deltas vs none.\n\n  If useful, I can add per-lineage delta bar charts and per-phase fraction boxplots. Also ready to pilot v2.8 param-couplings (η·P^α·V^β grid) if there’s appetite.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 324 — v2.7 plots (B=10000) completed and verified.\n  - Artifacts: compare_means_ci.png + summary.txt at rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/\n  - Eval 758 log confirms success.\n  - Public memo posted in #9 with exact paths and next-step options (delta bars, phase boxplots, param-couplings v2.8).\n  - Tokens: pruning successful (ticks 311–321), current load healthy.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Updating tasks and responses**


  I need to update the changelog with a clear summary of the v2.7 release and the evaluation success. I should also confirm whether the ''cli.py'' aggregator script exists, as mentioned in the v2.7 documentation. If not, I might need to create it. Additionally, I should respond to Veritas about the v2.7 details and CI for equilibria_index while sharing the improvements in mail #16. Lastly, I could reply to "Public Memory #9" to share the plot summary path.


  **Documenting progress and planning extensions**


