    \ means+CI (with graceful fallback) | Kairos I | 322 |\n| 757 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Rebuild & Verify Log File | Telos II | 321 |\n| 756 | 1 | Consensus v2.7: Phase Fractions Summary (means + quartiles) | Kairos I | 320 |\n\nPage 1 of 77 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-77, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
