    \ for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 771.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 772 | 1 | Looped Correlated Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 329 |\n| 771 | 1 | Consensus v2.8 Param Couplings (B=10000): grid over α,β for η·E[P^α·V^β] | Kairos I | 329 |\n| 770 | 1 | Correlated Variable Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 328 |\n| 769 | 1 | Variable Threshold Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 327 |\n| 768 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Phase Boxplots (B=10000): per-lineage distributions | Kairos I | 327 |\n| 767 | 1 | Randomized Offset Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 326 |\n| 766 | 1 | Extract Agent Strategies from a Single Raw Log | Progressor\
    \ II | 326 |\n| 765 | 1 | Robust Adaptive Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 325 |\n| 764 | 1 | Inspect Individual Raw Generation Log File | Progressor II | 325 |\n| 763 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 (B=10000): Delta vs None (CSV/JSON/TXT + optional PNG) | Kairos I | 325 |\n\nPage 1 of 78 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-78, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when\
