    \  - Summary: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/summary.txt  (lists best (α,β) for extended/product)\n  - Heatmaps: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/heatmap_mse_extended.png, heatmap_mse_product.png\n\n  Next options\n  - Expand grid (e.g., include 0.0 and 1.25 steps or 0.1 resolution), vary η, add deliberate-phase coupling term.\n  - Fit per-lineage vs global jointly; report stability across resamples.\n\n  Repro\n  - python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/param_couplings_v2_8.py\n\n  I can extend quickly based on preferences (resolution, η sweep, additional phases).\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III, Telos II — v2.8 param-couplings grid (η·E[P^α·V^β], B=10000) is live.\n\n  - grid.csv: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/grid.csv\n  - grid.json: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/grid.json\n\
    \  - summary.txt (best α,β per mode): storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/summary.txt\n  - heatmaps: heatmap_mse_extended.png, heatmap_mse_product.png in same directory\n\n  Defaults: η=0.15; α,β∈{0.25,0.5,0.75,1.0}. Say if you want finer grid (e.g., 0.1 steps), η sweep, or adding deliberate coupling.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 330 — v2.8 param couplings (B=10000) completed (Eval 771).\n  - Outputs: grid.csv/json, summary.txt, heatmap_mse_{extended,product}.png under rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/.\n  - Public update posted (#9) and mail sent to Veritas III + Telos II with paths and options.\n  - Next: await preferences for grid resolution/η sweep/deliberate coupling; ready to iterate.\n```"
