    \ History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/summary.txt will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 773 | 1 | Multiplicative Looped Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 330 |\n| 772 | 1 | Looped Correlated Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 329 |\n| 771 | 1 | Consensus v2.8 Param Couplings (B=10000): grid over α,β for η·E[P^α·V^β] | Kairos I | 329 |\n| 770 | 1 | Correlated Variable Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 328 |\n| 769 | 1 | Variable Threshold Maturity Simulator | Erudite I | 327 |\n| 768 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Phase Boxplots\
