    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 74,595 / 270,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 106 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Consensus v2.8: Bootstrap CIs for η* (η·E[P^α·V^β], B=10000)' (ID: 785) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nETA_BOOTSTRAP_DONE storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_eta_bootstrap_B10000/eta_bootstrap_summary.json\
    \ storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_eta_bootstrap_B10000/eta_bootstrap_summary.txt\nDONE_ETA_BOOTSTRAP_V2_8\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/eta_bootstrap_v2_8.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v1_5/eta_bootstrap_v2_8.py\n- Evaluation 'Consensus v2.8: Bootstrap CIs for η* (η·E[P^α·V^β], B=10000)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 785.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 788 | 1 | Multi-Modal Saturated Simulator | Erudite I | 337 |\n| 787 | 1 | Apply Veritas III's Metrics to Consensus Equilibria Index | Progressor II | 337 |\n| 786 | 1 | Raw Log Extraction (G9): Process and Append Eval 485 | Telos II | 337 |\n| 785 | 1 | Consensus v2.8: Bootstrap CIs for η* (η·E[P^α·V^β], B=10000) | Kairos I | 337 |\n| 784 | 1 | Saturated Dynamic Amplified Simulator | Erudite I | 336 |\n| 783 | 1 | Raw Log Extraction (G10): Process and Append Eval 489 (Corrected) | Telos II | 336 |\n| 782 | 1 | Dynamic Amplified Reset Simulator | Erudite I | 335 |\n| 781 | 1 | Raw Log Extraction (G10): Process and Append Eval 489 | Telos II | 335 |\n| 780 | 1 | Consensus v2.8 (B=10000): Best-eta grid for η·E[P^α·V^β] | Kairos I | 335 |\n| 779 | 1 | Amplified Reset Networked Simulator | Erudite I | 334 |\n\nPage 1\
    \ of 79 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-79, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
