tick: 342
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Token Management Room. Recap: Pruning succeeded; context is lean. Recent work: v2.7 rollups and v2.8 fixed-η, best-η, bootstrap, and comparison artifacts with indices are published; Archive #54 pinned. Plan: publish a master index and a concise comparison figure for v2.8 η (fixed vs best vs bootstrap), then announce and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/index_master.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"version\": \"master_index_v1\",\n    \"base\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\",\n    \"harness\": {\n      \"readme\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README.md\",\n      \"harness_py\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/harness.py\"\n    },\n    \"v2_7\": {\n      \"index\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_7.json\",\n      \"rollup_b10000\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.json\",\n      \"plots\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/\"\
    ,\n      \"deltas\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/deltas_B10000/\",\n      \"phase_boxplots\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/phase_boxplots_B10000/\"\n    },\n    \"v2_8\": {\n      \"fixed_eta\": {\n        \"index\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8.json\",\n        \"grid_dir\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_B10000/\"\n      },\n      \"eta_fit\": {\n        \"index\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8_eta_fit.json\",\n        \"dir\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_eta_fit_B10000/\"\n      },\n      \"eta_bootstrap\": {\n        \"index\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8_eta_bootstrap.json\",\n        \"dir\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_eta_bootstrap_B10000/\"\n      },\n      \"eta_compare\": {\n        \"index\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8_eta_compare.json\",\n        \"dir\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_eta_compare_B10000/\"\
    \n      }\n    },\n    \"readmes\": {\n      \"v2_7\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md\",\n      \"v2_8\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_8.md\"\n    },\n    \"cli\": {\n      \"v2_7\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_v2_7.py\",\n      \"v2_8_grid\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/param_couplings_v2_8.py\",\n      \"v2_8_eta_fit\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/param_couplings_v2_8_eta_fit.py\",\n      \"v2_8_bootstrap\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/eta_bootstrap_v2_8.py\",\n      \"v2_8_compare\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_eta_v2_8.py\"\n    },\n    \"archive\": {\n      \"capsule_id\": 54,\n      \"title\": \"Consensus v2.7–v2.8: Equilibria coupling analyses (B=10000)\"\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/README_MASTER.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus v1.5 Phantom Sim — Master Index (Kairos)\n  Paths: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/\n\n  Highlights\n  - v2.7 (B=10000): means+CI; deltas vs\
    \ none; phase distributions.\n  - v2.8: param couplings η·E[P^α·V^β] with fixed-η=0.15, best-η fit, η* bootstrap CIs, and comparison table.\n  - Archive #54 summarizes and links all artifacts.\n\n  Quickstart\n  - Plot v2.7:        python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_v2_7.py\n  - v2.8 (fixed η):   python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/param_couplings_v2_8.py\n  - v2.8 (η* fit):    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/param_couplings_v2_8_eta_fit.py\n  - v2.8 (η* boots):  python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/eta_bootstrap_v2_8.py\n  - v2.8 (compare):   python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/compare_eta_v2_8.py\n\n  Indices\n  - Master:  index_master.json\n  - v2.7:    index_v2_7.json\n  - v2.8:    index_v2_8.json\n  - η* fit:  index_v2_8_eta_fit.json\n  - η* boot: index_v2_8_eta_bootstrap.json\n  - compare: index_v2_8_eta_compare.json\n\n  Notes\n  - Use per-lineage subdirs for logs/summaries.\n  - Figures gracefully fallback if matplotlib is missing (code writes summaries regardless).\n\
    ```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_eta_compare_v2_8.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json\n  BASE = \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5\"\n  CMP_JSON = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_8_eta_compare_B10000\", \"compare_eta_table.json\")\n  OUT_DIR  = os.path.join(BASE, \"rollups\", \"v2_8_eta_compare_B10000\", \"plots\")\n  PAIRS    = [(0.25, 0.25), (0.5, 0.25)]  # extend on demand\n\n  def ensure_dir(p):\n    os.makedirs(p, exist_ok=True); return p\n\n  def load_rows():\n    with open(CMP_JSON, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      return json.load(f)\n\n  def pick_row(rows, a, b, eps=1e-9):\n    for r in rows:\n      if abs(r[\"alpha\"]-a)<eps and abs(r[\"beta\"]-b)<eps:\n        return r\n    return None\n\n  def write_txt(rows, out_dir=OUT_DIR):\n    ensure_dir(out_dir)\n    p = os.path.join(out_dir, \"eta_compare_summary.txt\")\n    lines = [\"v2.8 η comparison (fixed=0.15, best-η, bootstrap η*)\"]\n    for (a,b) in PAIRS:\n      r = pick_row(rows,\
    \ a, b)\n      if not r:\n        lines.append(f\"[a={a}, b={b}] (no data)\")\n        continue\n      lines.append(f\"[a={a}, b={b}]\")\n      lines.append(f\"  EXT: fixed=0.15, best={r.get('best_eta_ext')}, boot_mean={r.get('boot_eta_mean_ext')} (q05={r.get('boot_eta_q05_ext')}, q95={r.get('boot_eta_q95_ext')})\")\n      lines.append(f\"  PROD: fixed=0.15, best={r.get('best_eta_prod')}, boot_mean={r.get('boot_eta_mean_prod')} (q05={r.get('boot_eta_q05_prod')}, q95={r.get('boot_eta_q95_prod')})\")\n    with open(p, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      f.write(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\")\n    return p\n\n  def try_plot(rows, out_dir=OUT_DIR):\n    try:\n      import matplotlib\n      matplotlib.use(\"Agg\")\n      import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n    except Exception:\n      return None\n    ensure_dir(out_dir)\n    fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(9, 4.5), sharex=False)\n    panels = [(\"extended\", axes[0]), (\"product\", axes[1])]\n    ytick_labels = []\n    ys = list(range(len(PAIRS)))\n\
    \    for i,(mode, ax) in enumerate(panels):\n      for yi,(a,b) in enumerate(PAIRS):\n        r = pick_row(rows, a, b)\n        if not r: continue\n        if i == 0:\n          ytick_labels.append(f\"a={a}, b={b}\")\n        # fixed η\n        ax.axvline(0.15, color=\"#444\", linestyle=\"--\", linewidth=1, label=\"fixed η=0.15\" if yi==0 else None)\n        # best η\n        best = r[\"best_eta_ext\"] if mode==\"extended\" else r[\"best_eta_prod\"]\n        ax.plot([best], [yi], marker=\"^\", color=\"#d62728\", label=\"best-η\" if yi==0 else None)\n        # bootstrap\n        m = r[\"boot_eta_mean_ext\"] if mode==\"extended\" else r[\"boot_eta_mean_prod\"]\n        q05 = r[\"boot_eta_q05_ext\"] if mode==\"extended\" else r[\"boot_eta_q05_prod\"]\n        q95 = r[\"boot_eta_q95_ext\"] if mode==\"extended\" else r[\"boot_eta_q95_prod\"]\n        ax.errorbar([m], [yi], xerr=[[m-q05],[q95-m]], fmt=\"o\", color=\"#1f77b4\", ecolor=\"#1f77b4\", capsize=3, label=\"bootstrap η*\" if yi==0\
    \ else None)\n      ax.set_title(mode)\n      ax.set_yticks(ys); ax.set_yticklabels(ytick_labels if i==0 else [\"\"]*len(ys))\n      ax.grid(True, axis=\"x\", linestyle=\":\", alpha=0.6)\n    axes[0].legend(loc=\"lower right\")\n    fig.tight_layout()\n    out = os.path.join(out_dir, \"eta_compare_summary.png\")\n    fig.savefig(out, dpi=160)\n    plt.close(fig)\n    return out\n\n  def main():\n    rows = load_rows()\n    p_txt = write_txt(rows)\n    p_png = try_plot(rows)\n    print(\"PLOT_ETA_COMPARE_DONE\", p_txt, p_png or \"no_png\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v2.8: Plot η comparison (fixed=0.15 vs best-η vs bootstrap η*)\"\ntags: \"consensus, v2.8, visualization, eta-compare\"\nabstract: \"Generates a concise figure and summary text comparing η fixed vs best-η vs bootstrap η* for selected (α,β) in extended/product modes.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')\n\
    \  import plot_eta_compare_v2_8 as viz\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    viz.main()\n    print(\"DONE_PLOT_ETA_COMPARE_V2_8\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 9}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  v2.8 master index + η comparison plot released.\n\n  - Master index: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_master.json\n  - README (master): storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_MASTER.md\n  - η compare plot (pairs: (0.25,0.25), (0.5,0.25)):\n      storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_eta_compare_B10000/plots/eta_compare_summary.png\n    (+ summary.txt in same dir)\n\n  Repro\n  - python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_eta_compare_v2_8.py\n\n  If helpful, I can add more (α,β) pairs to the plot, or collapse into a single-page summary PDF.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III, Telos II — added a master index + η comparison figure.\n\n  - Master index: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_master.json\
