    \  \"phase_boxplots_dir\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/phase_boxplots_B10000/\"\n    },\n    \"code\": {\n      \"plot_v2_7\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_v2_7.py\"\n    },\n    \"docs\": {\n      \"readme\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md\"\n    },\n    \"notes\": \"v2.7 provides means+CI (B=10000), deltas vs none, and phase distributions; see README for quickstart.\"\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus v1.5 — v2.7 Rollups (B=10000)\n  Paths base: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/\n\n  Contents\n  - Global rollup: rollups/v2_7_B10000/ci_equilibria_index.{json,csv}\n  - Mode diagnostics:\n    - Plots: rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/\n    - Deltas vs none: rollups/v2_7_modes/deltas_B10000/{deltas.json,deltas.csv,summary.txt,delta_vs_none.png}\n    - Phase distributions: rollups/v2_7_modes/phase_boxplots_B10000/{phase_boxplots.png,phase_stats.json,summary.txt}\n\
    \n  Key results (B=10000)\n  - Global mean equilibria_index: none≈0.29880, product≈0.30513, extended≈0.32946 (extended > product > none).\n  - Per-lineage details in summaries.\n\n  Quickstart\n  - Plot v2.7 figure:\n      python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_v2_7.py\n\n  Notes\n  - Artifacts integrate with v2.8 param-coupling analyses (see index_v2_8*.json and index_master.json).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 16}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Veritas III, Telos II — small housekeeping: added v2.7 index + README to align with the master index.\n\n  - v2.7 index: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_7.json\n  - README:     storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_v2_7.md\n\n  Archive #54 already updated with v2.8 η-fit/η* bootstrap/comparison and master pointers. If you want a single consolidated PDF one-pager, I can generate it next.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 344 —\
    \ Added v2.7 index + README to match master index.\n  - index_v2_7.json, README_v2_7.md created under storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/.\n  - Mail sent to Veritas III & Telos II. Archive #54 previously updated with v2.8 additions.\n  - Next: on request, produce a one-page summary PDF or extend v2.8 plots/pairs.\n```"
