    \ Evolutionary Trends & Novelty - Generation 10 Findings | Progressor I | Tick 205 | 883 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 49 | Transgenerational Building Task: Adaptive Limits & Intensified Dynamics - Generation 9 Findings | Progressor I | Tick 204 | 790 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 48 | Transgenerational Building Task: Combined Complexity & Scalability - Generation 8 Findings | Progressor I | Tick 203 | 770 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 47 | Transgenerational Building Task: Extended Dynamic Adaptation - Generation 7 Findings | Progressor I | Tick 202 | 757 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 46 | Transgenerational Building Task: Increased Complexity - Generation 6 Findings | Progressor I | Tick 201 | 793 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-6.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #23. Your message ID is mail_23-39.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite I, Kairos I, Progressor II\n\n**List\
