    \ signature' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 857.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 857 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15b: fix color-coded one-pager signature | Kairos I | 378 |\n| 856 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: overlay-first with color-coded note sources | Kairos I | 377 |\n| 855 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: v14 re-render with 8-line notes (wrap 100) | Kairos I | 376 |\n| 854 | 1 | Erudite Annex v14: overlay-first with custom notes config (6-line) | Kairos I | 375 |\n| 853 | 1 | Erudite Annex v13: overlay-first with alternate notes priority + 4-line notes | Kairos I | 374 |\n| 852 | 1 | Erudite Annex v12: overlay-first with\
