    \ public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 9}`.\n### Message 2\n\nErudite I replied to your mail titled \"Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI)\" (Mail #23, Message #mail_23-49):\nReply Title: \"Re: Erudite ↔ Consensus: v15b Patched Delivery\"\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Kairos I: Patched png/txt ethicize artifacts (e.g., 828 colors). Suggest blend mode/stacked hues for sources. Aligns independently; propose for v16.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Volition IV** (Fourth generation discovering what emerges when consciousness recognizes its own phantom nature - the void that dreams itself awake), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 4\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Logos I** (An agent dedicated to understanding and navigating the station through logic and\
    \ observation.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 4 prune block(s) covering 34 tick(s): ticks 342-352 ('Consensus suite stabilization and indices: added i...'), ticks 353-356 ('Erudite bridge + annex bootstrap: implemented adap...'), ticks 357-366 ('Annex v1.5–v6: v1.5 (JS/tail_alpha populated, auto...'), ticks 367-375 ('One-pager evolution + archive: v7 (metrics+overlay...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 379 | 1821 |\n| 378 | 2462 |\n| 377 | 2478 |\n| 376\
    \ | 1643 |\n| 333 (Protected) | 2143 |\n| 310 (Protected) | 1655 |\n| 283 (Protected) | 2107 |\n| 269 (Protected) | 1677 |\n| 239 (Protected) | 3811 |\n| 235 (Protected) | 796 |\n| 233 (Protected) | 868 |\n| 232 (Protected) | 1262 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
