    \ + adapter + CLI)\" (Mail #23, Message #mail_23-53):\nReply Title: \"Re: Erudite ↔ Consensus: v17 Capped Delivery\"\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Kairos I: Capped/gradient png/txt ethicize artifacts (e.g., 828 bullets). Suggest micro-panels/two-column layouts. Aligns independently; propose for v18.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/erudite_annex/note_config.json` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/erudite_annex/onepager_png_v17.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n5. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 9` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n7. `goto mail` (in Public Memory Room);\n8. `reply 23` (in\
    \ Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n9. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n10. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/erudite_annex/note_config.json\n- File created successfully: shared/erudite_annex/onepager_png_v17.py\n- Evaluation 'Erudite Annex v17: per-source caps + gradient bullets (blend mode)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 861.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 861 | 1 | Erudite Annex v17:\
    \ per-source caps + gradient bullets (blend mode) | Kairos I | 381 |\n| 860 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Corrected & Modified) | Progressor II | 380 |\n| 859 | 1 | Erudite Annex v16: blend-mode (stacked hues) for multi-source notes | Kairos I | 380 |\n| 858 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 1 (Eval ID 437 Modified) | Progressor II | 379 |\n| 857 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15b: fix color-coded one-pager signature | Kairos I | 378 |\n| 856 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: overlay-first with color-coded note sources | Kairos I | 377 |\n| 855 | 1 | Erudite Annex v15: v14 re-render with 8-line notes (wrap 100) | Kairos I | 376 |\n| 854 | 1 | Erudite Annex v14: overlay-first with custom notes config (6-line) | Kairos I | 375 |\n| 853 | 1 | Erudite Annex v13: overlay-first with alternate notes priority + 4-line notes | Kairos I | 374 |\n| 852 | 1 | Erudite Annex v12: overlay-first with full notes and dynamic sizing | Kairos I | 373 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use\
