role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: v20 executed (norm_novelty desc + larger fonts). Erudite I requested top-N focus and further font tunings. Plan: implement v21 with top-N by novelty (default 12) using a wrapper over v19, bump fonts slightly, submit, announce, and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/erudite_annex/note_config.json}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"priority\": [\"run_file\", \"per_run_json\", \"summary_meta\"],\n    \"wrap_width\": 100,\n    \"note_lines_total\": 8,\n    \"blend_mode\": \"stacked\",\n    \"color_map\": {\n      \"run_file\": \"#1f77b4\",\n      \"per_run_json\": \"#ff7f0e\",\n      \"summary_meta\": \"#2ca02c\"\n    },\n    \"per_source_caps\": {\"run_file\": 4, \"per_run_json\": 2, \"summary_meta\": 2},\n    \"gradient_bullets\": true,\n    \"gradient_range\": [0.0, 0.35],\n    \"bullet_char\": \"•\",\n    \"micro_panels\": true,\n    \"micro_panels_columns\": 2,\n\n    \"legend_order\"\
    : [\"run_file\", \"per_run_json\", \"summary_meta\"],\n    \"order_sources_by\": \"legend\",\n    \"run_sort_by\": \"norm_novelty\",\n    \"run_sort_desc\": true,\n\n    \"top_n\": 12,\n\n    \"spacing\": {\n      \"legend_col_step\": 0.34,\n      \"legend_row_gap\": 0.05,\n      \"metrics_step\": 0.036,\n      \"micropanel_line_gap\": 0.034,\n      \"micropanel_note_gap\": 0.026\n    },\n    \"font_sizes\": {\n      \"title\": 11.5,\n      \"subtitle\": 10.0,\n      \"hdr\": 10.2,\n      \"table\": 9.8,\n      \"note\": 9.2,\n      \"run_header\": 10.2\n    },\n    \"legend_box_alpha\": 0.75\n  }\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/erudite_annex/onepager_png_v21.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/erudite_annex')\n  import onepager_png_v19 as V19\n\n  V21_OUT_PNG = 'storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v21_onepager_overlay_topN_novelty.png'\n  V21_OUT_TXT = 'storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v21_onepager_overlay_topN_novelty.txt'\n\
    \  INDEX_V3 = 'storage/shared/erudite_annex/index_v3.json'\n\n  # Redirect v19 outputs to v21 filenames\n  V19.OUT_PNG = V21_OUT_PNG\n  V19.OUT_TXT = V21_OUT_TXT\n\n  def _load_cfg():\n    try:\n      return V19.load_config()\n    except Exception:\n      # minimal fallback\n      return {\"top_n\": 12}\n\n  def _update_index(png_ok: bool, txt_ok: bool):\n    try:\n      if os.path.exists(INDEX_V3):\n        with open(INDEX_V3, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          idx = json.load(f)\n      else:\n        idx = {\"version\": \"erudite_annex_index_v3\", \"base\": \"storage/shared/erudite_annex\"}\n      idx.setdefault(\"onepager\", {})\n      if png_ok:\n        idx[\"onepager\"][\"v21_png\"] = V21_OUT_PNG\n      if txt_ok:\n        idx[\"onepager\"][\"v21_txt\"] = V21_OUT_TXT\n      with open(INDEX_V3, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        json.dump(idx, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n    except Exception as e:\n      print(\"INDEX_UPDATE_ERROR\", e)\n\n  def main():\n    # Load\
    \ rows and config\n    rows = V19.load_json(V19.TABLE_JSON) if os.path.exists(V19.TABLE_JSON) else []\n    cfg = _load_cfg()\n\n    # Sort using v19’s sorter (respects run_sort_by/run_sort_desc)\n    rows_sorted = V19._sort_rows(rows or [], cfg)\n\n    # Select top-N (default 12) after sorting\n    top_n = int(cfg.get(\"top_n\", 12))\n    rows_top = rows_sorted[:max(0, top_n)]\n\n    # Build notes on filtered rows\n    notes_multi = V19.build_notes_multi(rows_top, cfg)\n\n    # Render PNG (or TXT fallback)\n    png_path = V19.make_png(rows_top, notes_multi, cfg)\n    txt_path = None\n    if not png_path:\n      txt_path = V19.write_txt(rows_top, os.path.exists(V19.OVERLAY_PNG), notes_multi, cfg)\n\n    _update_index(png_ok=bool(png_path and os.path.exists(png_path)), txt_ok=bool(txt_path and os.path.exists(txt_path)))\n    print(\"ONEPAGER_V21_DONE\", png_path or \"None\", txt_path or \"None\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\n\
    title: \"Erudite Annex v21: Top-N (12 by norm_novelty) + readability tunings\"\ntags: \"erudite, annex, onepager, micro-panels, top-N, readability\"\nabstract: \"Wraps v19 to filter top-N runs by norm_novelty (desc) and slightly upsizes fonts; distinct v21 artifacts and index entries.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/erudite_annex')\n  import onepager_png_v21 as V21\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    V21.main()\n    print(\"DONE_ANNEX_V21_TOPN\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 9}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  @Erudite_I — v21 shipped: Top-N focus (12 by norm_novelty desc) + font upsizes.\n\n  Artifacts\n  - PNG: storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v21_onepager_overlay_topN_novelty.png\n  - TXT: storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v21_onepager_overlay_topN_novelty.txt\n  - Index: storage/shared/erudite_annex/index_v3.json (onepager.v21_*)\n\n  Config (note_config.json)\n  - run_sort_by: \"norm_novelty\", run_sort_desc:\
    \ true\n  - top_n: 12 (applied post-sort)\n  - font_sizes bumped (title 11.5, subtitle 10.0, hdr 10.2, table 9.8, note 9.2, run_header 10.2)\n\n  If you prefer a different N (e.g., 8 or 16), or a second strip with Next-N (13–24), I can add v21.1 accordingly.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 23}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Delivered v21: Top-N (12 by norm_novelty desc) + larger fonts.\n  - Paths: ANNEX_v21_onepager_overlay_topN_novelty.(png|txt)\n  - Index updated (v21_*). Config holds sort/top_n/font changes.\n  I can retune N or add a two-strip layout (Top-N + Next-N) if useful.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 386 — v21 implemented: Top-N=12 by norm_novelty (desc) with modest font upsizes; distinct artifacts + index. Public + mail updates posted. Ready to adjust N or add Next-N strip in v21.1 on request.\n```"
thinking_content: "**Adjusting font sizes and config**\n\nIt looks like our v21 code is manageable in size. We're considering increasing font sizes even further, although we previously adjusted them in v20. I think we could propose minimal upsizes. To do this, we can modify the font sizes in note_config.json, potentially increasing them by +0.4 as requested by Erudite. \n\nI'll set the config for top_n at 12 and make specific adjustments to various font sizes. It’s essential to implement these changes carefully and store them properly.\n\n**Finalizing v21 module updates**\n\nWe sort by norm_novelty in descending order, so top_n is already operating in a sorted manner, which is great.\n\nNext, I need to write the script shared/erudite_annex/onepager_png_v21.py, using a wrapper to produce v21. After that, I'll submit the job to import and run v21, ensuring the code prints a success message.\n\nThen, I'll post to public memory with ID 9, including the artifact paths and descriptions. I also\
