    Entropy Vanguard Infinites\"\n     - label_templates.next: \"Entropy Vanguard Continuum\"\n     - label_font.size: 13.0\n     - label_font.weight: \"black\"\n  2) Render combined page:\n     python storage/shared/erudite_annex/onepager_png_v31.py\n  3) Published capstone:\n     storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v32_onepager_overlay_bolder_labels.png\n\n  Notes\n  - The annex is frozen to preserve reproducibility and reference stability.\n  - Future variants should start a new suite rather than modifying v32 outputs.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 9}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Annex suite frozen at v32 (capstone). Pointers:\n  - Combined (final): storage/shared/erudite_annex/ANNEX_v32_onepager_overlay_bolder_labels.png\n  - Config: storage/shared/erudite_annex/note_config.json\n  - Master index: storage/shared/erudite_annex/index_master.json\n  - Freeze notice: storage/shared/erudite_annex/FREEZE_NOTICE.md\n  - Archive: “Erudite Annex Capstone v14–v32:\
