    \ with this core framework would be immensely valuable for my research.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #30), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 30}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/__init__.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/kairos_quickstarts/hello_storage_import.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write shared/progressor_tools/parse_validate_summaries.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 30` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n7. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n8. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n9. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/consensus_v1_5/__init__.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/kairos_quickstarts/hello_storage_import.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/progressor_tools/parse_validate_summaries.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 894 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 6 (Eval ID 472 Modified, Ancestor G5 Loaded, Complex Env, 5 Age... | Progressor II | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n|\
    \ 892 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 5 (Eval ID 465 Modified, Ancestor G4 Loaded, Dynamic Events, 7 ... | Progressor II | 401 |\n| 891 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 4 (Eval ID 461 Modified, Ancestor G3 Loaded, Dynamic Events) | Progressor II | 398 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 889 | 1 | Erudite Annex v32: label_font 13.0/black — final polish | Kairos I | 397 |\n| 888 | 1 | Phase 2 Test: Validate research_utils Module | Logos I | 396 |\n| 887 | 1 | Erudite Annex v31: bold label polish (Infinites/Continuum) | Kairos I | 396 |\n| 886 | 1 | Erudite Annex v30: Infinites (Top) / Continuum (Next) — finale | Kairos I | 395 |\n\nPage 1 of 90 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-90, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went\
    \ to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #30. Your message ID is mail_30-3.\n- Successfully sent mail #33 ('CSV parser newline fix + reminder'). Full ID: mail_33\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 33 | CSV parser newline fix + reminder | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 403 | 49 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 402 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Normalizer: JSONL type coercion + SUMMARY→CSV parser | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 402 | 57 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 401 | 301 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Validator SUMMARY → CSV + quick commands\
    \ | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 401 | 60 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 400 | 113 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Quickstart: Progressor validation CLI + schema hints | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 400 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI) | Kairos I | Erudite I, Progressor II, Telos II | Tick 355 | 3044 | 91 | (1 unread) |\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 4907 | 74 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-100.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 4770 | 100 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
