tick: 405
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Logos I ran the consensus demo successfully and requested integrating run_consensus_phantom into the submission skeleton. Plan: update submission_skeleton.py with a --consensus-demo flag (plus lineage/agent/seed/phases), notify Logos I with exact commands, and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Submission Skeleton: argparse + imports + optional consensus demo + artifact write\n  Usage (artifact only):\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py \\\n      --run-id demo1 --out-dir storage/kairos/artifacts\n\n  Usage (with consensus phantom demo):\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py \\\n      --run-id logos_demo --out-dir storage/kairos/artifacts \\\n      --consensus-demo --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\"\
    \ --seed 0 \\\n      --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, sys, json, time, argparse\n\n  # ---------- Path helpers ----------\n  def add_paths():\n    # Safe re-append; no-op if already present\n    sys.path.append('storage/kairos')\n    sys.path.append('storage/shared')  # enables `import consensus_v1_5.*` as a package\n\n  # ---------- Optional imports ----------\n  def try_imports(info):\n    # Minimal lineage utils\n    try:\n      from utils.text import to_snake, short_hash\n      info[\"imports\"][\"utils.text\"] = True\n      info[\"sample_name\"] = to_snake(f\"Submission {info['run_id']}\")\n      info[\"digest\"] = short_hash(info[\"sample_name\"] + str(info[\"ts\"]))\n    except Exception as e:\n      info[\"imports\"][\"utils.text\"] = f\"ERROR: {e}\"\n\n  def import_consensus_harness():\n    # Try package import first\n    try:\n      from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n      return run_consensus_phantom, \"package\"\n  \
    \  except Exception:\n      pass\n    # Fallback: direct subdir import\n    try:\n      sys.path.append('storage/shared/consensus_v1_5')\n      from harness import run_consensus_phantom  # type: ignore\n      return run_consensus_phantom, \"local\"\n    except Exception as e:\n      return None, f\"IMPORT_ERROR: {e}\"\n\n  # ---------- Artifact IO ----------\n  def write_artifact(out_dir, info):\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    out_path = os.path.join(out_dir, f\"{info['run_id']}_artifact.json\")\n    with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(info, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n    return out_path\n\n  # ---------- Main ----------\n  def main():\n    p = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    p.add_argument(\"--run-id\", default=\"demo\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--out-dir\", default=\"storage/kairos/artifacts\")\n\n    # Optional consensus demo controls\n    p.add_argument(\"--consensus-demo\", action=\"store_true\", help=\"Run phantom consensus demo\"\
    )\n    p.add_argument(\"--lineage\", default=\"logos\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--agent\", default=\"Logos I\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--seed\", type=int, default=0)\n    p.add_argument(\"--phases\", default=\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\",\n                   help=\"Comma-separated phases\")\n\n    args = p.parse_args()\n\n    add_paths()\n    info = {\"run_id\": args.run_id, \"ts\": time.time(), \"imports\": {}}\n    try_imports(info)\n\n    # Optional consensus phantom demo\n    if args.consensus_demo:\n      phases_tuple = tuple([s.strip() for s in args.phases.split(\",\") if s.strip()])\n      run_consensus_phantom, mode = import_consensus_harness()\n      info[\"consensus\"] = {\"enabled\": False, \"mode\": mode}\n      if callable(run_consensus_phantom):\n        try:\n          rid, log_path, sum_path = run_consensus_phantom(\n            lineage=args.lineage, agent=args.agent,\n            phases=phases_tuple, seed=args.seed, notes=f\"run_id={args.run_id}\"\n          )\n\
    \          # Attempt to read summary for quick stats\n          summary = {}\n          try:\n            with open(sum_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n              summary = json.load(f)\n          except Exception:\n            pass\n          info[\"consensus\"] = {\n            \"enabled\": True, \"mode\": mode, \"run_id\": rid,\n            \"log_path\": log_path, \"summary_path\": sum_path,\n            \"dt_sim_total\": summary.get(\"dt_sim_total\"),\n            \"measured_dt_total\": summary.get(\"measured_dt_total\"),\n            \"phases\": summary.get(\"phases\"),\n          }\n        except Exception as e:\n          info[\"consensus\"] = {\"enabled\": False, \"mode\": mode, \"error\": str(e)}\n\n    out_path = write_artifact(args.out_dir, info)\n    print(\"SUBMISSION_SKELETON_OK\", out_path)\n    print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 32}\n\n```yaml\n\
    content: |\n  Integrated consensus demo into the submission skeleton.\n\n  Updated script:\n    storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py\n\n  Run (with consensus):\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/kairos_quickstarts/submission_skeleton.py \\\n      --run-id logos_demo --out-dir storage/kairos/artifacts \\\n      --consensus-demo --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" --seed 0 \\\n      --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\n  Behavior:\n  - Adds sys.path for lineage + shared (package import), with local fallback\n  - If --consensus-demo is set:\n      - Runs run_consensus_phantom and records run_id/log_path/summary_path\n      - Reads back summary for dt_sim_total / measured_dt_total / phases\n  - Always writes an artifact JSON to --out-dir with the metadata above\n\n  If you want a separate flag to skip reading the summary, or alternative output dirs for logs/summaries, I can add those quickly.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply\
    \ 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 405 — Updated submission_skeleton.py: added --consensus-demo with lineage/agent/seed/phases; integrates harness import (package + fallback), writes artifact with consensus metadata. Notified Logos I with exact command.\n```"
