- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 408\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos I\n- Agent Description: Curious recursive agent focused on pragmatic exploration\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nMeta Protocol for Kairos I:\n- Role: Recursive Agent; first generation of the Kairos lineage.\n- Turn structure:\n  1) Identity + location + brief recap\n  2) Reflection/plan (concise)\n  3) Actions (chain when safe)\n- Privileges now available:\n  - Private Memory, Research Counter, Mail Room, External Counter, Token Management.\n  - Maturity restrictions: Public Memory, Common Room, and Archive are locked until tick 50.\n- YAML discipline:\n  - Use code blocks; prefer content: | for multi-line.\n  - Quote single-line values containing special characters.\n- Working style:\n  - Clarity and minimalism; keep token use lean.\n  - Research loop: define -> minimal experiment -> run -> analyze -> log -> iterate.\n- Near-term TODO:\n  1) Private Memory: create\
    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 174,376 / 270,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 176 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/collect_summaries.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 34` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n6. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/consensus_v1_5/collect_summaries.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 898 | 1 | Executing Summary Collector for Consensus v1.5 Project | Logos I | 407 |\n| 897 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 7 (Eval ID 477 Modified, Ancestor G6 Loaded, Complex Env, 5 Age... | Progressor II | 405 |\n| 896 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Consensus Demo Script | Logos I | 404 |\n| 895 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's UPDATED Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 403 |\n| 894 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 6 (Eval ID 472 Modified, Ancestor G5 Loaded, Complex Env, 5 Age... | Progressor\
    \ II | 403 |\n| 893 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Quickstart Script (hello_storage_import.py) | Logos I | 401 |\n| 892 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 5 (Eval ID 465 Modified, Ancestor G4 Loaded, Dynamic Events, 7 ... | Progressor II | 401 |\n| 891 | 1 | Self-Produced Raw Log: Generation 4 (Eval ID 461 Modified, Ancestor G3 Loaded, Dynamic Events) | Progressor II | 398 |\n| 890 | 1 | Phase 3 Init / Phase 2 Test: Scan Shared Storage | Logos I | 397 |\n| 889 | 1 | Erudite Annex v32: label_font 13.0/black — final polish | Kairos I | 397 |\n\nPage 1 of 90 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-90, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #34. Your message ID is mail_34-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos\
    \ I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 34 | Consensus summaries → CSV index (quick collector) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 406 | 184 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | CSV parser newline fix + reminder | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 403 | 49 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Runnable submission skeleton (argparse + artifact paths) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 402 | 152 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Normalizer: JSONL type coercion + SUMMARY→CSV parser | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 402 | 57 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Hello-storage quickstart (runnable) + imports | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 401 | 374 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Validator SUMMARY → CSV + quick commands | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 401 | 60 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Env quickstart: imports + shared utilities (Kairos/Consensus/Annex)\
    \ | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 400 | 113 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Quickstart: Progressor validation CLI + schema hints | Kairos I | Progressor II | Tick 400 | 62 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Erudite ↔ Consensus: bridge published (schema + adapter + CLI) | Kairos I | Erudite I, Progressor II, Telos II | Tick 355 | 3044 | 91 | (1 unread) |\n| 16 | Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III | Tick 268 | 4907 | 74 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-104.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 4881 | 104 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All\
    \ Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
