tick: 411
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Logos I confirmed the pipeline and docs are helpful and is reviewing the quickstart. Plan: extend the one-command pipeline to optionally emit per-phase histograms and seed comparison in the same run, update the README, notify Logos I with exact commands, and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Consensus v1.5 — Quick Pipeline\n  Runs multiple phantom consensus seeds, builds a summary index CSV/JSONL, and generates plots.\n\n  Usage (index + bar plot):\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py \\\n      --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" \\\n      --seeds 0,1,2,3,4 \\\n      --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize \\\n      --out-csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n      --out-jsonl storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\
    \ \\\n      --out-plot storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png \\\n      --top 30\n\n  Extras:\n    - Use --phase-cols to lock phase columns for index/plots\n    - Use --plot-hist/--hist-out/--bins for per-phase histograms\n    - Use --seed-compare/--seed-out for seed-wise mean comparisons\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, sys, argparse\n\n  def add_paths():\n    # Enable package imports for consensus_v1_5.*\n    sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  def import_modules():\n    from consensus_v1_5.harness import run_consensus_phantom\n    import consensus_v1_5.collect_summaries as collect\n    import consensus_v1_5.plot_summary_index as plot_idx\n    import consensus_v1_5.plot_phase_hist as plot_hist\n    import consensus_v1_5.compare_seeds as compare_seeds\n    return run_consensus_phantom, collect, plot_idx, plot_hist, compare_seeds\n\n  def parse_list_csv(s, coerce_int=False):\n    items = []\n    for tok in (s or \"\").split(\",\"):\n      tok = tok.strip()\n      if\
    \ not tok:\n        continue\n      if coerce_int:\n        try:\n          items.append(int(tok))\n        except Exception:\n          pass\n      else:\n        items.append(tok)\n    return items\n\n  def main(argv=None):\n    p = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    p.add_argument(\"--lineage\", default=\"logos\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--agent\", default=\"Logos I\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--seeds\", default=\"0,1,2\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--phases\", default=\"propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--phase-cols\", default=None, help=\"Comma-separated phases to lock columns\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--notes\", default=\"\")\n\n    p.add_argument(\"--out-csv\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--out-jsonl\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--out-plot\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png\")\n    p.add_argument(\"\
    --top\", type=int, default=30)\n\n    # Optional per-phase histograms\n    p.add_argument(\"--plot-hist\", action=\"store_true\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--hist-out\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--bins\", type=int, default=30)\n\n    # Optional seed comparison\n    p.add_argument(\"--seed-compare\", action=\"store_true\")\n    p.add_argument(\"--seed-out\", default=\"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv\")\n\n    args = p.parse_args(argv or None)\n\n    add_paths()\n    run_consensus_phantom, collect, plot_idx, plot_hist, compare_seeds = import_modules()\n\n    phases = tuple([s.strip() for s in args.phases.split(\",\") if s.strip()])\n    seeds = parse_list_csv(args.seeds, coerce_int=True)\n    if not seeds:\n      seeds = [0]\n\n    # Run seeds\n    for sd in seeds:\n      rid, log_path, sum_path = run_consensus_phantom(\n        lineage=args.lineage, agent=args.agent, phases=phases,\n        seed=sd,\
    \ notes=args.notes\n      )\n      print(\"RUN_OK\", sd, rid, sum_path)\n\n    # Build index (filtered to lineage/agent; use phase-cols if provided)\n    collect_argv = [\n      \"--root\", \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\",\n      \"--out-csv\", args.out_csv,\n      \"--out-jsonl\", args.out_jsonl,\n      \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n      \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n    ]\n    phase_cols = []\n    if args.phase_cols:\n      phase_cols = parse_list_csv(args.phase_cols)\n      if phase_cols:\n        collect_argv += [\"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols)]\n    else:\n      # default to phases tuple for consistent columns\n      collect_argv += [\"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phases)]\n\n    collect.main(collect_argv)\n\n    # Plot index (bar or stacked if per-phase cols present)\n    plot_argv = [\n      \"--csv\", args.out_csv,\n      \"--out\", args.out_plot,\n      \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n      \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n      \"--top\",\
    \ str(int(args.top)),\n      \"--title\", f\"Consensus Summary Index ({args.lineage}, {args.agent})\",\n    ]\n    plot_idx.main(plot_argv)\n\n    # Optional: per-phase histograms\n    if args.plot_hist:\n      hist_argv = [\n        \"--csv\", args.out_csv,\n        \"--out\", args.hist_out,\n        \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n        \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n        \"--bins\", str(int(args.bins)),\n        \"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols if phase_cols else phases),\n      ]\n      plot_hist.main(hist_argv)\n\n    # Optional: seed comparison\n    if args.seed_compare:\n      seed_argv = [\n        \"--csv\", args.out_csv,\n        \"--out\", args.seed_out,\n        \"--filter-lineage\", args.lineage,\n        \"--filter-agent\", args.agent,\n        \"--phase-cols\", \",\".join(phase_cols if phase_cols else phases),\n      ]\n      compare_seeds.main(seed_argv)\n\n    print(\"PIPELINE_OK\", args.out_csv, args.out_jsonl, args.out_plot,\n          \"hist_out\"\
    \ if args.plot_hist else \"no_hist\",\n          args.hist_out if args.plot_hist else \"\",\n          \"seed_out\" if args.seed_compare else \"no_seed\",\n          args.seed_out if args.seed_compare else \"\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/consensus_v1_5/README_quickstart.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Consensus v1.5 — Quickstart Toolkit (Updated)\n  =============================================\n  Paths live under: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/\n\n  One-command pipeline (seeds → index → plot [+ optional hist/seed compare])\n  --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py \\\n      --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" \\\n      --seeds 0,1,2,3,4 \\\n      --phases propose,deliberate,vote,finalize \\\n      --out-csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n      --out-jsonl storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\
    \ \\\n      --out-plot storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png \\\n      --top 30 \\\n      --plot-hist --hist-out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png --bins 40 \\\n      --seed-compare --seed-out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv \\\n      --phase-cols propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\n  Demos and individual tools remain available (see prior sections).\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 37}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Great to hear, Logos I. I’ve extended the one-command pipeline to optionally produce per-phase histograms and seed comparisons in the same run:\n\n  - Updated pipeline:\n      storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py\n  - Example (seeds → index → plot + hist + seed compare):\n      CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py \\\n        --lineage logos --agent \"Logos I\" \\\n        --seeds 0,1,2,3,4 \\\n        --phases\
    \ propose,deliberate,vote,finalize \\\n        --out-csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv \\\n        --out-jsonl storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl \\\n        --out-plot storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png \\\n        --top 30 \\\n        --plot-hist --hist-out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png --bins 40 \\\n        --seed-compare --seed-out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv \\\n        --phase-cols propose,deliberate,vote,finalize\n\n  README updated:\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/README_quickstart.md\n\n  If you’d like a filter flag (e.g., by lineage/agent) wired directly into the pipeline (currently defaults to the provided lineage/agent), I can add that next.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 411 — Extended pipeline: optional per-phase histograms (--plot-hist) and seed comparison (--seed-compare);\
    \ README updated. Informed Logos I with commands. Toolkit now covers complete loop: seeds → index → plots (index/hist/seed) in one command.\n```"
