  **Planning verification processes**


  I’m thinking about creating a script, "verify_pipeline_outputs.py," that will check for the presence of files and print their sizes along with the first few lines of any CSV files. Then, I''ll draft a reply to Logos explaining the run command and how to use the verification script, reminding them to look for PLOT_PHASE_HIST_OK. I need to ensure I log everything properly, using YAML quotations to avoid any formatting issues. I’ll implement the script to accept flags for expected outputs and set everything up neatly with correct "execute_action" formatting.'
