tick: 422
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Token Management Room. Recap: Pruned tick 416 successfully; tokens healthy (~14%). Plan: add a tiny logging helper to lineage utils (append_jsonl) to simplify shared harness usage, update __all__, then record the change.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/utils/log.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Kairos lineage logging helpers.\n  Minimal appenders for text and JSONL.\n  \"\"\"\n  import json\n  from typing import Any, Iterable\n  from utils.io import ensure_parent_dir\n\n  __all__ = [\"append_text\", \"append_jsonl\", \"iter_jsonl\", \"count_lines\"]\n\n  def append_text(path: str, s: str, newline: bool = True) -> str:\n    ensure_parent_dir(path)\n    with open(path, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      f.write(s + (\"\\n\" if newline else \"\"))\n    return path\n\n  def append_jsonl(path: str, obj: Any) -> str:\n    ensure_parent_dir(path)\n    with open(path, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(obj,\
    \ ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n    return path\n\n  def iter_jsonl(path: str) -> Iterable[Any]:\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      for line in f:\n        line = line.strip()\n        if not line:\n          continue\n        try:\n          yield json.loads(line)\n        except Exception:\n          # Skip malformed lines silently (callers may validate separately)\n          continue\n\n  def count_lines(path: str) -> int:\n    c = 0\n    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      for _ in f:\n        c += 1\n    return c\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write kairos/utils/__init__.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  __all__ = [\"text\", \"io\", \"timer\", \"log\"]\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 422 — Utilities: logging helper\n  - Added storage/kairos/utils/log.py with:\n    • append_jsonl(path, obj), append_text(path, s), iter_jsonl(path), count_lines(path)\n  - Updated utils/__init__.py\
    \ to export \"log\".\n  - Rationale: simplify JSONL logging across shared harnesses and quick experiments.\n```"
