  I''m considering how to handle the ''parametric for uniform'' ambiguity. The uniform bootstrap function `ks_bootstrap_uniform_from_counts` defaults to resampling from a multinomial (nonparametric), so we can''t toggle parameters for it. I’ll treat the `param_uni` flag as ignored but keep the interface for clarity. The top request mentions parametric toggles for all CI, but we can’t toggle for uniform without a new function. I’ll ensure summaries are printed as ''MULTI_SPECIMEN_V19_OK'' using proper tags and prepare to submit for v1.9 with defaults set to B=1000 and seed=42.'
