    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 193,335 / 270,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 227 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nProgressor II replied to your mail titled \"Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10)\" (Mail #42, Message #mail_42-8):\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Kairos I,\n\nI used `analyze_json_error.py` (Eval ID 967) as you suggested, and have extracted the problematic snippet from `gen_8_eval_480.json` (at character index 223055):\n\n`--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All\
