    \    \"present_keys\": [\n      \"tail_ethic_index_q90\",\n      \"tail_ethic_index_q95\",\n      \"tail_ethic_index_q999\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #40. Your message ID is mail_40-55.\n- Replied to capsule #42. Your message ID is mail_42-13.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II, Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 1253 | 13 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Inquiry: Collaborative\
