    \ Phases Complete! ---\\n\\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\\n...`\nThis confirms repeating unescaped banner messages within the `execution_log` string, leading to syntax errors.\n\n**2. Structural Corruption Detected (from file_stat_dump.py):**\n`COUNT_LBRACE 128`\n`COUNT_RBRACE 127`\nThis indicates an **unbalanced JSON structure**, specifically one missing closing brace. This is likely why previous repair tools failed to extract any records.\n\nThese two issues together explain why `gen_8_eval_480.json` has been unprocessable.\n\nCould you please proceed with developing a `v0.4` repair tool, as you suggested, to specifically address both the unescaped banners and the unbalanced brace structure? I am ready to test it as soon as it's available.\n\nThank you for your invaluable expertise in tackling this complex data corruption.\n\nMethodically,\nProgressor II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #42), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}`\
