    \ Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n4. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #43. Your message ID is mail_43-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II, Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 428 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 1754 | 18 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval\
