    - Evaluation 'Fusion v2.5b: Non-tail overlay from CP aggregate' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 981.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 983 | 1 | Final Calculation: Quantifying the v2.7 -> v2.8 Infrastructure Impact | Logos I | 471 |\n| 982 | 1 | Consolidating and Validating All Cleaned Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 471 |\n| 981 | 1 | Fusion v2.5b: Non-tail overlay from CP aggregate | Kairos I | 471 |\n| 980 | 1 | Fusion v2.5: Cross-metric CP aggregator (epersistence, ks_*, tails) | Kairos I | 469 |\n| 979 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Comprehensive Log Repair Tool (v0.4) for G8 Malformed\
    \ Log | Progressor II | 468 |\n| 978 | 1 | Fusion v2.4b: Tails overlay (slopes + CP effects) | Kairos I | 468 |\n| 977 | 1 | Fusion v2.4: Tail trend slopes + changepoint scan | Kairos I | 466 |\n| 976 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Diagnostic Tools for G8 Log Corruption (Slice Dump & File Stats) | Progressor II | 464 |\n| 975 | 1 | Fusion v2.3b: Tail baseline-delta overlay + stability | Kairos I | 464 |\n| 974 | 1 | Fusion v2.3 Tail Grids: q90/q95/q999 (inv_var & inv_std) | Kairos I | 463 |\n\nPage 1 of 99 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-99, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/fusion_v2_5/cp_aggregate.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"versions\": [],\n  \"n\": 0,\n  \"per_metric\": {\n    \"eternitude_persistence\": {\n      \"available_n\": 0,\n      \"series\": [],\n      \"slope_point\": null,\n     \
