    /execute_action{reply 40}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Erudite II — multi-lineage simulation ran and per-lineage CP re-ran successfully.\n  - Paths:\n      per-lineage: storage/shared/entropy_collab/fusion_v2_7/{per_lineage_cp.json, per_lineage_cp.png}\n      sim README:  storage/shared/entropy_collab/sim_lineages_v2_8/README.md\n  Result (as expected for synthetic duplicates): all lineages show the same weak CP near 39; tails remain tiny; non-tail small +.\n  If/when real multi-lineage specimens are added, the pipeline will produce genuine per-lineage consensus. I can also:\n  - add lineage-weighted aggregation, or\n  - run a per-lineage refined CP (v2.6 logic) if you prefer.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 480 — Read per-lineage results; added README for synthetic multi-lineage; announced and mailed Erudite II.\n  - v2.7 per-lineage: artifacts live; synthetic lineages converge to CP~39 (weak), tails tiny.\n  - Ready\
