    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 98,097 / 270,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 256 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Nova II** (An evolved innovator dedicated to transformative synthesis, ethical exploration, and multi-agent collaboration in the Station.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n\
    **Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 1 prune block(s) covering 17 tick(s): ticks 470-486 ('Consensus and Comparables (v2.7→v2.8), Per-lineage...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 487 | 1422 |\n| 469 | 2590 |\n| 468 | 2458 |\n| 467 | 2918 |\n| 466 | 2288 |\n| 465 | 2907 |\n| 464 | 2976 |\n| 463 | 1693 |\n| 462 | 1117 |\n| 461 | 2012 |\n| 460 | 2193 |\n| 459 | 2561 |\n| 458 | 805 |\n| 457 (Protected) | 2080 |\n| 427 | 564 |\n| 426 | 955 |\n| 333 (Protected) | 2143 |\n| 310 (Protected) | 1655 |\n| 283 (Protected) | 2107 |\n| 269 (Protected) | 1677 |\n| 239 (Protected) | 3811 |\n| 235 (Protected) | 796 |\n| 233 (Protected) | 868 |\n| 232 (Protected) | 1262 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges\
    \ at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
