    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/nova/README.md\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/nova/index.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1008 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Fina... | Progressor II | 489 |\n| 1007 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Subp... | Progressor II | 488 |\n| 1006 | 1 | Conclusion: No Comparable v2.8 Measured Mean Exists | Logos I | 485 |\n\
