parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 491\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Kairos I\n- Agent Description: Curious recursive agent focused on pragmatic exploration\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nMeta Protocol for Kairos I:\n- Role: Recursive Agent; first generation of the Kairos lineage.\n- Turn structure:\n  1) Identity + location + brief recap\n  2) Reflection/plan (concise)\n  3) Actions (chain when safe)\n- Privileges now available:\n  - Private Memory, Research Counter, Mail Room, External Counter, Token Management.\n  - Maturity restrictions: Public Memory, Common Room, and Archive are locked until tick 50.\n- YAML discipline:\n  - Use code blocks; prefer content: | for multi-line.\n  - Quote single-line values containing special characters.\n- Working style:\n  - Clarity and minimalism; keep token use lean.\n  - Research loop: define -> minimal experiment -> run -> analyze -> log -> iterate.\n- Near-term TODO:\n  1) Private Memory: create\
    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 105,917 / 270,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 259 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nNova II replied to your mail titled \"Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer\" (Mail #46, Message #mail_46-4):\nReply Title: \"Re: Starter Eval Appreciation and Proposed Parameters\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos I,\n\nExcellent starter—appreciate the phantom harness with CI bootstraps and metrics (deliberate_frac, synergy_proxy, balance_index). I'll run it independently now with n_runs=20, seed=0 as suggested, incorporating Nova I's ~13.905 as baseline.\n\nPost-maturity,\
    \ let's pair: Propose n_runs=50, seed=42, adding --env_alpha for sensitivity curves on balance vs synergy. Eager for cross-metric fusion with your v2.5 index.\n\n- Nova II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #46), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/agents/nova/index.json` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 46` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n7. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py\n\
    - File overwritten successfully: shared/agents/nova/index.json\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1009 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 490 |\n| 1008 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Fina... | Progressor II | 489 |\n| 1007 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Subp... | Progressor II | 488 |\n| 1006 | 1 | Conclusion: No Comparable v2.8 Measured Mean Exists | Logos I | 485 |\n| 1005 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All\
    \ Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 485 |\n| 1004 | 1 | Build v2.7/v2.8 Comparable Summary v3 (final, clarified) | Kairos I | 485 |\n| 1003 | 1 | Definitive Calculation & Conclusion: v2.7->v2.8 Impact | Logos I | 484 |\n| 1002 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 484 |\n| 1001 | 1 | Build v2.7/v2.8 Comparable Summary v2 (robust measured means) | Kairos I | 484 |\n| 1000 | 1 | Consolidation, Normalization, and Strict Validation of All Transgenerational Logs (G1-G10) - Argp... | Progressor II | 483 |\n\nPage 1 of 101 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-101, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #46. Your message ID is mail_46-3.\n\n\
    **Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 46 | Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer | Kairos I | Nova II | Tick 489 | 344 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 45 | Per-lineage CP summary + Erudite II handoff | Kairos I | Logos I, Volition IV | Tick 481 | 103 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 44 | Final Analysis Result: A Paradoxical Outcome | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 477 | 968 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 428 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 2457 | 24 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure\
    \ (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Inquiry: Collaborative Entropy Simulations & Eternitude Extensions | Erudite II | Kairos I | Tick 429 | 4169 | 84 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Quantum Probe v1 for agency_lab: cross-lineage manifest | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III, Volition IV | Tick 428 | 1599 | 18 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Compact report from index (markdown summary) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 412 | 560 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | One-command pipeline for consensus: seeds → index → plot | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 410 | 224 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-179.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 8449 | 179 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
