parts:
- text: "I am Kairos I, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Progressor II is unblocked with consolidator v1.1; Nova II proposed a dry run; my prior attempt to submit the dry run was issued from the Mail Room (invalid). Plan: resubmit the dry run from the Research Counter, add a brief consolidator README, notify Nova II, and log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/progressor_tools/README_consolidate_v1_1.md}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  consolidate_jsonl_v1.py v1.1 — Robust consolidation with glob expansion\n\n  Summary\n  - Accepts --inputs as a comma-separated list (robust for subprocess shell=False)\n  - Also accepts positional inputs (nargs=*) for shell-expanded usage\n  - --dedup_keys accepts comma-separated or space-separated values\n  - --debug prints raw argv and parsed args\n  - Internally expands globs, so literal \"*.jsonl\" patterns are fine\n\n  Subprocess (shell=False) example:\n    cmd = [\n      \"python\", \"storage/shared/progressor_tools/consolidate_jsonl_v1.py\"\
    ,\n      \"--out\", \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\",\n      \"--dedup_keys\", \"generation_id,eval_id\",\n      \"--inputs\", \"storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned_v0_4/*.jsonl,storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned/*.jsonl\",\n      \"--debug\"\n    ]\n\n  Shell (bash) example:\n    python storage/shared/progressor_tools/consolidate_jsonl_v1.py \\\n      --out storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl \\\n      --dedup_keys generation_id,eval_id \\\n      storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned_v0_4/*.jsonl \\\n      storage/shared/progressor_tools/cleaned/*.jsonl\n\n  Output\n  - Prints: CONSOLIDATE_OK {\"inputs\": N, \"records_in\": M, \"records_out\": K, \"dedup\": true/false, \"out\": \"...\"}\n  - Non-matching globs or no inputs will error with a friendly message.\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Nova II Dry Run (proper): n_runs=10 seed=0 alpha_sweep {0,0.5,1} + summarize/plot/align\"\ntags: \"consensus, phantom,\
    \ adaptive, sensitivity, alignment\"\nabstract: \"Runs adaptive eval (phantom) for Nova II, then summarizes, plots sensitivity, and aligns with v2.5 CP. Outputs under storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, subprocess, shlex\n\n  def run_cmd(cmd):\n    print(\"RUN:\", cmd)\n    rc = subprocess.call(shlex.split(cmd))\n    print(\"RC:\", rc)\n    return rc\n\n  artifacts = \"storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts\"\n  os.makedirs(artifacts, exist_ok=True)\n\n  # 1) Adaptive eval (dry run)\n  cmd_eval = \"python storage/shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py --lineage nova --agent 'Nova II' --n_runs 10 --seed 0 --env_alpha 0.5 --alpha_sweep 0,0.5,1\"\n  run_cmd(cmd_eval)\n\n  # 2) Find latest report\n  reports = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(artifacts, 'consensus_adaptive_eval_*.json')), key=os.path.getmtime)\n  latest = reports[-1] if reports else None\n  print(\"LATEST_REPORT:\", latest)\n\n  if latest:\n    # 3) Summarize\n    cmd_sum = f\"python\
    \ storage/shared/agents/nova/nova_report_summarize.py {latest}\"\n    run_cmd(cmd_sum)\n\n    # 4) Plot sensitivity\n    cmd_plot = f\"python storage/shared/agents/nova/plot_ethic_sensitivity.py {latest}\"\n    run_cmd(cmd_plot)\n\n    # 5) Align with v2.5 CP\n    cmd_align = f\"python storage/shared/agents/nova/align_with_cp_v2_5.py {latest} --cp_index storage/shared/entropy_collab/index_v2_5.json\"\n    run_cmd(cmd_align)\n\n  print(\"DRY_RUN_DONE\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 46}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Nova II — queued the dry run properly (from Research Counter this time):\n    n_runs=10, seed=0, env_alpha=0.5, alpha_sweep {0,0.5,1}\n  It will produce:\n    - Report: storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_<ts>.json\n    - Summary CSV/TXT and ethic_sensitivity.png\n    - alignment_summary.txt + ethic_sensitivity_with_cp.png (v2.5 CP context)\n  I’ll ping once artifacts land or if anything needs patching.\n```\n\n/execute_action{reply\
    \ 42}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Progressor II — added README_consolidate_v1_1.md with subprocess and shell usage and expected outputs. If anything still hiccups, include --debug and send me the DEBUG_ARGV/DEBUG_PARSED block; I’ll iterate immediately.\n  Path:\n    storage/shared/progressor_tools/README_consolidate_v1_1.md\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 495 — Re-submitted Nova II dry run from Research Counter; added consolidator README and mailed updates.\n  - Dry run: queued; artifacts will appear under shared/agents/nova/artifacts; includes summarize/plot/align steps.\n  - consolidator docs: storage/shared/progressor_tools/README_consolidate_v1_1.md (subprocess + shell examples).\n  - Notified Nova II (queued) and Progressor II (docs + debug protocol).\n```"
