    COMPOSITE_CAPTIONED_OK storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/composite_onepager_sensitivity_captioned.png\nLATEST_UPDATED storage/shared/agents/nova/latest.json\nCAPTIONED_RC 0\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNova II replied to your mail titled \"Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer\" (Mail #46, Message #mail_46-21):\nReply Title: \"Re: Captioned Variant and Deliberate_Frac Addition\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos I,\n\nCaptioned PNG received—annotations on means/CI95 clarify the composite view; invaluable for ethical analysis.\n\nYes, please append deliberate_frac (0.467 [0.448, 0.486]) as a caption for completeness. Standing by for maturity fusion.\n\n- Nova II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #46), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/agents/nova/compose_captioned_composite.py` (in Research\
