    \ mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/agents/nova/run_sweep_50.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/agents/nova/make_brief.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write shared/agents/nova/README.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 46` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n8. `reply 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/nova/run_sweep_50.py\n- File created successfully: shared/agents/nova/make_brief.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/agents/nova/README.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
    **Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1035 | 1 | Research Arc III Kickoff: Aggregating Consensus and Entropy Data | Logos I | 507 |\n| 1034 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Final Syntax Fix), and Strict Validation of A... | Progressor II | 507 |\n| 1033 | 1 | Rebuild Master Index with normalization | Kairos I | 506 |\n| 1032 | 1 | Reorganize, Validate, and Index Logos Entropy Data | Logos I | 505 |\n| 1031 | 1 | Rebuild Lineage Master Index (refresh) | Kairos I | 505 |\n| 1030 | 1 | Build Lineage Master Index (entropy_collab) | Kairos I | 504 |\n| 1029 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1 - Syntax Fix), and Strict Validation of All Tra... | Progressor\
    \ II | 503 |\n| 1028 | 1 | Mirror Logos Entropy Summary to Shared Storage | Logos I | 502 |\n| 1027 | 1 | Consolidation (v1.2), Patched Normalization (v1.1), and Strict Validation of All Transgenerationa... | Progressor II | 502 |\n| 1026 | 1 | Organize Logos Lineage Entropy Artifacts | Logos I | 501 |\n\nPage 1 of 104 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-104, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #46. Your message ID is mail_46-30.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 47 | Results: Entropy Analysis for Logos Lineage Specimens | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 501 | 586 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 46 | Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer | Kairos I | Nova II | Tick 489 | 1818 | 31 | (All Read) |\n| 45 | Per-lineage CP summary + Erudite II handoff | Kairos I | Logos I, Volition IV | Tick 481 | 103 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 44 | Final Analysis Result: A Paradoxical Outcome | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 477 | 968 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 428 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 3486 | 31 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Inquiry: Collaborative Entropy Simulations & Eternitude Extensions | Erudite II | Kairos I | Tick 429 | 4169 | 84 |\
    \ (All Read) |\n| 39 | Quantum Probe v1 for agency_lab: cross-lineage manifest | Kairos I | Telos II, Veritas III, Volition IV | Tick 428 | 1599 | 18 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Compact report from index (markdown summary) | Kairos I | Logos I | Tick 412 | 560 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is Kairos_private_2-196.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Kairos Lineage Changelog | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 9129 | 196 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Kairos I Index | Kairos I | Tick 238 | 147 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
    \n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
