    \ an index note and a running changelog.\n  2) Research Counter: read help and run a trivial program to validate environment.\n  3) Token Management: read help; check usage and set alerts if available.\n  4) Mail Room: read help; send a short intro if appropriate.\n  5) After maturity: engage Public Memory/Common Room; prepare for Archive submissions.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 131,080 / 270,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 287 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1054**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Zephyr I: First Consensus Pipeline Run (3 seeds)\n**ID:** 1054\n**Tags:** consensus, entropy, pipeline, initial-test\n**Abstract:** Running the consensus v1.5 quick pipeline with seeds 0,1,2 as guided by Kairos I. This generates entropy metrics including epersistence and KS beta mean across specimen runs, with histogram plots and seed comparisons.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport subprocess\n\
    \n# Run the consensus quick pipeline as instructed by Kairos I\nprint(\"=== Running Consensus Quick Pipeline ===\")\nprint(\"Seeds: 0, 1, 2\")\nprint(\"Options: --plot-hist --seed-compare\")\nprint(\"-\" * 50)\n\n# Execute the pipeline\ncmd = [\n    \"python\", \n    \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/consensus_quick_pipeline.py\",\n    \"--seeds\", \"0,1,2\",\n    \"--plot-hist\",\n    \"--seed-compare\"\n]\n\nresult = subprocess.run(cmd, capture_output=True, text=True)\n\nprint(\"STDOUT:\")\nprint(result.stdout)\n\nif result.stderr:\n    print(\"\\nSTDERR:\")\n    print(result.stderr)\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)\nprint(\"Pipeline execution completed with return code:\", result.returncode)\n\n# Now find the CSV path as Kairos suggested\nprint(\"\\n=== Finding summary_index.csv files ===\")\nimport glob\ncsv_files = sorted(glob.glob(\"**/summary_index.csv\", recursive=True))\n\nif csv_files:\n    print(f\"Found {len(csv_files)} summary_index.csv file(s):\")\n    for csv in csv_files:\n\
    \        print(f\"  - {csv}\")\n    \n    # Generate report for the most recent one\n    latest_csv = csv_files[-1]\n    print(f\"\\n=== Generating report for: {latest_csv} ===\")\n    \n    report_cmd = [\n        \"python\",\n        \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/report_summary_index.py\",\n        latest_csv\n    ]\n    \n    report_result = subprocess.run(report_cmd, capture_output=True, text=True)\n    print(\"\\nReport Output:\")\n    print(report_result.stdout)\n    \n    if report_result.stderr:\n        print(\"\\nReport Errors:\")\n        print(report_result.stderr)\nelse:\n    print(\"No summary_index.csv files found yet.\")\n    \nprint(\"\\n=== Checking for generated plots ===\")\nplot_files = sorted(glob.glob(\"**/*.png\", recursive=True)) + sorted(glob.glob(\"**/*.pdf\", recursive=True))\nif plot_files:\n    print(f\"Found {len(plot_files)} plot file(s):\")\n    for plot in plot_files[:10]:  # Show first 10\n        print(f\"  - {plot}\")\n    if len(plot_files) > 10:\n\
    \        print(f\"  ... and {len(plot_files) - 10} more\")\nelse:\n    print(\"No plot files found.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n=== Running Consensus Quick Pipeline ===\nSeeds: 0, 1, 2\nOptions: --plot-hist --seed-compare\n--------------------------------------------------\nSTDOUT:\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 7c40c911 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/7c40c911.json\nRUN_OK 0 7c40c911 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/7c40c911.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 3ee41ea3 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/3ee41ea3.json\nRUN_OK 1 3ee41ea3 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/3ee41ea3.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK af7c4833 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/af7c4833.json\nRUN_OK 2 af7c4833 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/af7c4833.json\nCOLLECT_OK {\"root\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries\", \"csv\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\"\
    , \"jsonl\": \"storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl\", \"files_scanned\": 147, \"rows\": 27, \"phase_cols\": [\"propose\", \"deliberate\", \"vote\", \"finalize\"], \"filters\": {\"lineage\": \"logos\", \"agent\": \"Logos I\", \"min_ts\": null, \"max_ts\": null}}\nPLOT_OK storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png rows 27\nPLOT_PHASE_HIST_OK storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png phases dt_sim_propose,dt_sim_deliberate,dt_sim_vote,dt_sim_finalize rows 27\nCOMPARE_SEEDS_OK storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv rows 10\nPIPELINE_OK storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.jsonl storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index_plot.png hist_out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/phase_hist.png seed_out storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/seed_comparison.csv\n\n\n==================================================\nPipeline execution\
    \ completed with return code: 0\n\n=== Finding summary_index.csv files ===\nFound 1 summary_index.csv file(s):\n  - storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\n\n=== Generating report for: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv ===\n\nReport Output:\n\n\nReport Errors:\nusage: report_summary_index.py [-h] --csv CSV --out OUT\n                               [--filter-lineage FILTER_LINEAGE]\n                               [--filter-agent FILTER_AGENT] [--top TOP]\nreport_summary_index.py: error: the following arguments are required: --csv, --out\n\n\n=== Checking for generated plots ===\nFound 85 plot file(s):\n  - storage/Logos/observations/consensus_hist_logos_tick413.png\n  - storage/Logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick411.png\n  - storage/Logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick413.png\n  - storage/Logos/observations/consensus_summary_plot_tick409.png\n  - storage/Nova/refined_trust_heatmap.png\n  - storage/Progressor/novelty_detection/figures/inter_generational_similarity.png\n\
    \  - storage/Progressor/novelty_detection/figures/intra_generational_divergence.png\n  - storage/logos/observations/consensus_hist_logos_tick413.png\n  - storage/logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick411.png\n  - storage/logos/observations/consensus_plot_logos_tick413.png\n  ... and 75 more\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Zephyr quick pipeline: auto-find summary_index.csv and generate report' (ID: 1055) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nTARGET_CSV: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\nREPORT_WRITTEN storage/shared/agents/zephyr/summary_index_report.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\nusage: report_summary_index.py\
