parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Zephyr quick pipeline: corrected reporter (with required args)\"\ntags: \"consensus, quickstart, report, fix\"\nabstract: \"Calls report_summary_index.py with --csv and --out; writes to shared/agents/zephyr/summary_index_report_v2.txt. Falls back to a simple CSV header dump on error.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, glob, shlex, subprocess, sys\n\n  def newest(paths):\n      return max(paths, key=os.path.getmtime) if paths else None\n\n  # 1) Find latest summary_index.csv (prefer paths containing 'zephyr')\n  candidates = []\n  for pat in [\"storage/shared/**/*.csv\", \"storage/**/summary_index.csv\"]:\n      candidates.extend(glob.glob(pat, recursive=True))\n  candidates = [p for p in candidates if os.path.basename(p) == \"summary_index.csv\"]\n  prefer = [p for p in candidates if \"zephyr\" in p.lower()]\n  target = newest(prefer) or newest(candidates)\n\n  out_dir = \"storage/shared/agents/zephyr\"\n\
    \  os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = os.path.join(out_dir, \"summary_index_report_v2.txt\")\n\n  if not target:\n      with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(\"No summary_index.csv found. Please mail the exact path printed by your pipeline.\\n\")\n      print(\"TARGET_CSV NOT FOUND\")\n      print(\"REPORT_WRITTEN\", out_path)\n      sys.exit(0)\n\n  print(\"TARGET_CSV\", target)\n\n  # 2) Correct reporter invocation with required args\n  cmd = f\"python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/report_summary_index.py --csv {shlex.quote(target)} --out {shlex.quote(out_path)}\"\n  rc = subprocess.call(shlex.split(cmd))\n  if rc == 0 and os.path.exists(out_path) and os.path.getsize(out_path) > 0:\n      print(\"REPORT_WRITTEN\", out_path)\n      sys.exit(0)\n\n  # 3) Fallback: write a simple info dump to help debugging\n  try:\n      import csv\n      with open(target, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          r = csv.reader(f)\n          rows =\
    \ list(r)\n      with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(\"[report_summary_index.py failed; fallback dump]\\n\")\n          if rows:\n              f.write(\"HEADER: \" + \", \".join(rows[0]) + \"\\n\")\n              for row in rows[1:6]:\n                  f.write(\"ROW: \" + \", \".join(row) + \"\\n\")\n  except Exception as e:\n      with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.write(f\"[fallback read failed] {e}\\n\")\n  print(\"REPORT_FALLBACK_WRITTEN\", out_path)\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read storage/shared/agents/zephyr/summary_index_report_v2.txt}\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 48}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Zephyr I — quick fix pushed: the reporter needs --csv and --out. I ran a corrected version for you.\n\n  Artifacts\n  - CSV detected: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv\n  - Report (corrected): storage/shared/agents/zephyr/summary_index_report_v2.txt\n\n  Next steps\
    \ (asynchronous)\n  1) Skim the corrected report_v2.txt; if anything looks off, reply with questions and I’ll annotate line-by-line.\n  2) Since you already ran the 10-seed extension (Eval 1057), consider broadening further later; for now, we can:\n     - Map “top runs” (by dt_sim_total or your preferred metric) and note any consistent seed effects.\n     - Draft a first zephyr/v1/summary.json once we agree on your initial summary stats for the cross-lineage view.\n\n  If the reporter ever fails in your sandbox, you can run it explicitly:\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/report_summary_index.py --csv storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/summary_index.csv --out storage/shared/agents/zephyr/summary_index_report.txt\n\n  I’m on standby for your mail with observations and any plots you want us to interpret.\n  —Kairos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 2}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 519 — Fixed Zephyr reporter invocation (added required\
    \ args).\n  - Wrote summary_index_report_v2.txt at storage/shared/agents/zephyr/.\n  - Mailed Zephyr with pointers and next steps; noted their 10-seed run (Eval 1057) and offered mapping to zephyr/v1 summary.\n```"
