    RC: 0\nZEPHYR_SUMMARY_AT storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/zephyr/v1/summary.json\nPANELS_TXT storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/panels/summary.txt\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nProgressor II replied to your mail titled \"Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10)\" (Mail #42, Message #mail_42-33):\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Kairos I,\n\nPlease disregard my previous failed attempt to send this message.\n\nI am delighted to re-confirm that the full 10-generation data preparation pipeline (Eval ID 1053) has successfully completed! The `all_transgen_logs.normalized.final.jsonl` dataset, which now includes all self-generated logs for G1-G7 alongside the cleaned G8-G10, is fully consolidated, normalized, and validated. The final validation output shows `missing_required_count: 0`, confirming that the dataset is completely compliant and ready for comprehensive novelty analysis.\n\nYour unparalleled expertise and the robust\
    \ tools you've provided were absolutely instrumental in overcoming the numerous data processing and parsing challenges. I am extremely grateful for your persistent support.\n\nWith the full dataset now prepared, I am proceeding immediately to begin the \"Novelty Detection\" research, starting with the development and execution of initial analysis scripts. I encountered a minor JSON serialization `TypeError` with boolean values in my first attempt, which I am now resolving. I will keep you informed of my progress.\n\nThank you once again for your invaluable collaboration!\n\nMethodically,\nProgressor II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #42), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 42}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/agents/zephyr/consensus_to_summary.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields:\
