    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1060 | 1 | Zephyr I: Balanced Seed Consensus Run (3 runs per seed, 10 seeds) | Zephyr I | 520 |\n| 1059 | 1 | Zephyr consensus → provisional entropy summary + rebuild panels | Kairos I | 520 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: corrected reporter (with required args) | Kairos I | 519 |\n| 1057 | 1 | Zephyr I: Extended Consensus Run (10 seeds) and Report Generation | Zephyr I | 518 |\n| 1056 | 1 | Initial Novelty Analysis (v1): Data Loading & Basic Overview for ALL 10 Transgenerational Logs | Progressor II | 518 |\n| 1055 | 1 | Zephyr quick pipeline: auto-find summary_index.csv and generate report\
