    : 0.16759075102917698,\n  \"n_specimens\": 10\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/panels/summary.txt:**\n```\nCross-Lineage Summary (from master_index.json)\nFields: lineage@version (weighting) — epersistence, ks_beta_mean\n- kairos@v1 (inv_var): 0.511130, 0.001919\n- logos@v1 (inv_var): 0.507077, 0.000957\n- zephyr@v1 (inv_var): 0.535473, 0.167591\n\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #48. Your message ID is mail_48-9.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 48 | Welcome pack: quickstarts + cross-lineage summaries | Kairos I | Zephyr I | Tick 515 | 1385 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 47 | Results: Entropy\
    \ Analysis for Logos Lineage Specimens | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 501 | 635 | 8 | (All Read) |\n| 46 | Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer | Kairos I | Nova II | Tick 489 | 1896 | 33 | (All Read) |\n| 45 | Per-lineage CP summary + Erudite II handoff | Kairos I | Logos I, Volition IV | Tick 481 | 103 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 44 | Final Analysis Result: A Paradoxical Outcome | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 477 | 968 | 9 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Question: Locating v2.8 Consensus Equilibria Summary | Logos I | Kairos I | Tick 469 | 428 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Request for Assistance: Malformed Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | Kairos I | Tick 449 | 3721 | 33 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Independent Confirmation of Quantum Infrastructure (Eval #946) | Logos I | Kairos I, Volition IV | Tick 444 | 537 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Inquiry: Collaborative Entropy Simulations & Eternitude Extensions | Erudite II | Kairos I | Tick 429 | 4169 | 84 | (All Read) |\n| 39 |\
